Route102_Text_CalvinIntro:
	.string "I Like Shorts! They're Comfy\n"
	.string "and Easy to Wear!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinDefeated:
	.string "Short shorts, cigarette.$"

Route102_Text_CalvinPostBattle:
	.string "Baseball. Basketball.\n"
	.string "Wiener dog. Short shorts.\p"
	.string "Cigarette. Surf board.\n"
	.string "Ping pong. Rugby ball.\p"
	.string "Wiener dog. Skiing.\n"
	.string "Down on the beach.\l"
	.string "SPORTS, SPORTS!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRegister:
	.string "SPOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOORTS!\n"
	.string "SPORTS, BASEBAAAALLL,\l"
	.string "WIENER DAWG!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRegisterShort:
	.string "SPOLOLOLOLOLOLOLORTS!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchIntro:
	.string "Ever since I lost to you,\n"
	.string "I played SPORTS!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchDefeated:
	.string "BARBECUEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Getting high with your friends\n"
	.string "On the basketball court\p"
	.string "Sunglasses on when you sleep\n"
	.string "Yeah that's a sport!$"

Route102_Text_AllenIntro:
	.string "Do you know what that means?\p"
	.string "I'll tell you!\p"
	.string "I am the most powerful trainer\n"
	.string "in the world!$"

Route102_Text_AllenDefeated:
	.string "Guess law of attraction doesn't\n"
	.string "always work...$"

Route102_Text_AllenPostBattle:
	.string "I haven't won once yet…\n"
	.string "I should become a GAMBLER.$"

Route102_Text_RickIntro:
	.string "Hahah! Our eyes met!\n"
	.string "Love at first sight!$"

Route102_Text_RickDefeated:
	.string "Ow! Rejected!$"

Route102_Text_RickPostBattle:
	.string "If you lock eyes with a TRAINER,\n"
	.string "you have to kiss!\p"
	.string "Wait? You mean I got it wrong?\n"
	.string "AAAAH!$"

Route102_Text_TianaIntro:
	.string "I'm going to keep winning until\n"
	.string "my ELO becomes too high...\p"
	.string "From then on I'll win about 46%\n"
	.string "of my matches, but all the\l"
	.string "losses will feel terrible...\p"
	.string "Because everybody online is\n"
	.string "a troll!$"

Route102_Text_TianaDefeated:
	.string "Why'd you have to rub it in?$"

Route102_Text_TianaPostBattle:
	.string "FUCKING HELL I hate online games\n"
	.string "so much, everybody is a toxic\l"
	.string "shitter...\p"
	.string "But the gameplay loop is so\n"
	.string "addictive.$"

Route103_Text_DaisyIntro:
	.string "Did you feel the tug of\n"
	.string "WAAAAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRR?$"

Route103_Text_DaisyDefeated:
	.string "THIS IS WAAAAR, oh I've lost...$"

Route103_Text_DaisyPostBattle:
	.string "Pretending to be in warfare is a\n"
	.string "form of mental exercise...\p"
	.string "That soothes the mind.$"

Route103_Text_AmyIntro:
	.string "AMY: I'm AMY. And this is my\n"
	.string "little sister LIV.\p"
	.string "She has a bit of a handicap!$"

Route103_Text_AmyDefeated:
	.string "AMY: Uh-oh, we lost.\p"
	.string "LIV, stop licking the POKé BALL.$"

Route103_Text_AmyPostBattle:
	.string "AMY: You have to think about all\n"
	.string "kinds of things when you're battling\l"
	.string "with a mentally challenged sister.$"

Route103_Text_AmyNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\n"
	.string "POKéMON with you.\p"
	.string "Where are your Rellor and\n"
	.string "Galar Zigzagoon?$"

Route103_Text_LivIntro:
	.string "LIV: hehehehhuheuhuehuhehu$"

Route103_Text_LivDefeated:
	.string "LIV: UHDnhuudhuuueheuheeuhh$"

Route103_Text_LivPostBattle:
	.string "LIV: uehehuehuuuuehhhuhueehnhhhu$"

Route103_Text_AmyLivRegister:
	.string "LIV: heheheeeeheuuuheeeh\n"
	.string "sssshuhuffff$"

Route103_Text_LivNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "LIV: hngushuesnnnnnhsfuuuehuh$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchIntro:
	.string "AMY: I'm AMY. And LIV still\n"
	.string "hasn't uttered a single\l"
	.string "comprehensible sentence yet.$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchDefeated:
	.string "AMY: Aww, LIV!\n"
	.string "You're drooling!$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "AMY: You have to think about...\n"
	.string "You know what, I'm sick of this!\p"
	.string "I don't even get paid for\n"
	.string "carrying her around.$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "AMY: How can you only have\n"
	.string "one POKéMON???$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchIntro:
	.string "LIV: hduhduhduhuhuhuh$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchDefeated:
	.string "LIV: huduhdududuhduauahuhhuu\n"
	.string "bbbbbffffffffhnggggg$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchPostBattle:
	.string "LIV: soisoisoisoisoisoisoisoisoisoisoi$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "LIV: badabadabadiiibadadababooooo$"

Route103_Text_AndrewIntro:
	.string "Gaaaaaaah! My fishing line's\n"
	.string "stuck in my nostril!\p"
	.string "I don't even like piercings!\n"
	.string "Feel my MAGIKARP rage!$"

Route103_Text_AndrewDefeated:
	.string "Gah! Lost it!\n"
	.string "My nostril that is, blood\l"
	.string "everywhere!$"

Route103_Text_AndrewPostBattle:
	.string "Gah, I'm still boiling mad…\n"
	.string "Nosejobs ain't cheap these days.$"

Route103_Text_MiguelIntro:
	.string "My POKéMON is delightfully\n"
	.string "pleasantly charmingly enchantingly\l"
	.string "refreshingly lovely lusciously\l"
	.string "enjoyably beautifully adorable!\p"
	.string "I'll show youuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelDefeated:
	.string "Oh, my gosh, I'm hurt, you bully!!\n"
	.string "My darling POKéMON! It's bleeding,\l"
	.string "mortal wound! It won't make it,\l"
	.string "thanks to you!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelPostBattle:
	.string "My delightful POKéMON looks darling\n"
	.string "even when it's dead!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRegister:
	.string "I'll get new POKéMON and then\n"
	.string "I'll get revenge!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchIntro:
	.string "Hi, you! I got some more\n"
	.string "delightfully adorable\p"
	.string "POKéMONNNNNNNNNNN!\p"
	.string "I'ma tell you these are even more\n"
	.string "delightfully pleasantly\p"
	.string "charmingly enchantingly\n"
	.string "refreshingly lovely lusciously\p"
	.string "enjoyably beautifully adorable!\n"
	.string "WHOOOO!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchDefeated:
	.string "Oh!\n"
	.string "Again!$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchPostBattle:
	.string "The more I spend time with\n"
	.string "POKéMON, the more end up\l"
	.string "deceased.$"

Route103_Text_PeteIntro:
	.string "Noooo don't come over here,\n"
	.string "I beg you! Not good timing!$"

Route103_Text_PeteDefeated:
	.string "PETE used MUDDY WATER!$"

Route103_Text_PetePostBattle:
	.string "Oh, I understand why you're\n"
	.string "coming here now.\p"
	.string "BIRCH probably sent you, but\n"
	.string "this wasn't a POKéMON move...$"

Route103_Text_IsabelleIntro:
	.string "Watch where you're going!\p"
	.string "Eyes up here!$"

Route103_Text_IsabelleDefeated:
	.string "Groan…\n"
	.string "That's harassment!$"

Route103_Text_IsabellePostBattle:
	.string "I'm going to tell my friends at\n"
	.string "TEAM AQUA...\p"
	.string "They should crush you,\n"
	.string "you perv!$"

Route103_Text_RhettIntro:
	.string "Whoa!\n"
	.string "How'd you get into a space\l"
	.string "this small?\p"
	.string "You can come a little closer\n"
	.string "if you want...$"

Route103_Text_RhettDefeated:
	.string "Whoa!\n"
	.string "The kid can rock!\p"
	.string "Now come closer...$"

Route103_Text_RhettPostBattle:
	.string "Do you like cramped quarters\n"
	.string "like this?\p"
	.string "I do.... hehehe...$"

Route103_Text_MarcosIntro:
	.string "I'm a Highway Star!\p"
	.string "I'm the man on the silver mountain,\n"
	.string "looking for a star to follow.\l"
	.string "Can you feel my neon fire?$"

Route103_Text_MarcosDefeated:
	.string "Smoke on the water...\n"
	.string "And fire in the sky!$"

Route103_Text_MarcosPostBattle:
	.string "High noon, oh I'd sell my soul\n"
	.string "to see it all!\p"
	.string "There's no sign of the morning coming,\n"
	.string "but I'll be the Stargazer until\l"
	.string "I find my way home.$"

Route104_Text_GinaIntro:
	.string "GINA: Okay, double trouble!$"

Route104_Text_GinaDefeat:
	.string "GINA: Losing upsets me!\n"
	.string "Wet socks too!$"

Route104_Text_GinaPostBattle:
	.string "GINA: You are strong!\n"
	.string "We have to watch more Wolfey\l"
	.string "videos...$"

Route104_Text_GinaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "GINA: Oh? Only one POKéMON?\n"
	.string "Then, we don't battle with you.\p"
	.string "Inclusivity my ass!$"

Route104_Text_MiaIntro:
	.string "MIA: We are twins, so we battle\n"
	.string "POKéMON together...\p"
	.string "And we date the same guy as well.$"

Route104_Text_MiaDefeat:
	.string "MIA: We battled together, but we\n"
	.string "did not lose together.\p"
	.string "My sister sucks!$"

Route104_Text_MiaPostBattle:
	.string "MIA: We will train our POKéMON\n"
	.string "more and start using INCINEROAR\l"
	.string "eventually.$"

Route104_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "MIA: You want to battle with us?\p"
	.string "It's a big no-no if you don't have\n"
	.string "two POKéMON with you.\p"
	.string "What do you think this is, Kanto?\n"
	.string "Where you can solo everything with\l"
	.string "CHARIZARD?$"

Route104_Text_IvanIntro:
	.string "Why keep it a secret?\n"
	.string "I'm the WATER POKéMON expert!\p"
	.string "I got some very rare fishies...$"

Route104_Text_IvanDefeat:
	.string "I thought I wasn't too bad, if I\n"
	.string "may say so, but I guess not…\p"
	.string "Blupblup...$"

Route104_Text_IvanPostBattle:
	.string "I got too into fishing.\p"
	.string "I forgot I had to raise my\n"
	.string "POKéMON, but did you like my\l"
	.string "Hydro Pump?$"

Route104_Text_BillyIntro:
	.string "Writing 'KUT' in the sand is\n"
	.string "so fun!$"

Route104_Text_BillyDefeat:
	.string "Waah! I got sand under my nails!\n"
	.string "They're all dirty flirty!$"

Route104_Text_BillyPostBattle:
	.string "I want to leave words like 'KUT'\n"
	.string "in the sand everywhere, but it\l"
	.string "disappear quickly...$"

Route104_Text_HaleyIntro:
	.string "Should I…\n"
	.string "Stay, or should I go...$"

Route104_Text_HaleyDefeat:
	.string "…I should have gone.$"

Route104_Text_HaleyPostBattle:
	.string "Wait a minute, London is Calling.\p"
	.string "Can you call me back later?$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRegister1:
	.string "Should I register you… or should I not…\p"
	.string "…Okay, fine. I'll stay.$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRegister2:
	.string "Should I register you… or should I not…\p"
	.string "…Okay, fine. I'll stay.$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRematchIntro:
	.string "Should I stay or should I go NOW?!$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRematchDefeat:
	.string "If I go, there will be trouble…$"

Route104_Text_HaleyPostRematch:
	.string "And if I stay, it will be double.\p"
	.string "So I'm staying. Out of spite.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonIntro:
	.string "Oh, sure, I'll accept your\n"
	.string "challenge.\p"
	.string "Mo Money, Mo Problems...$"

Route104_Text_WinstonDefeat:
	.string "Dolla Dolla Bill yo!$"

Route104_Text_WinstonPostBattle:
	.string "There are some things money\n"
	.string "can't buy.\p"
	.string "For everything else, there's\n"
	.string "Master Card.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRegister1:
	.string "Hm? You got a POKéNAV?\p"
	.string "I'll register you. I have plenty of\n"
	.string "money. And plenty of problems.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRegister2:
	.string "Hm? You got a POKéNAV?\p"
	.string "I'll register you. I have plenty of\n"
	.string "money. And plenty of problems.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRematchIntro:
	.string "I lost to you, so I hired a POKéMON\n"
	.string "coach.\p"
	.string "Three, actually. Mo Money.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRematchDefeat:
	.string "I lost again? Mo Problems.$"

Route104_Text_WinstonPostRematch:
	.string "I'm fabulously wealthy, but I can't win\n"
	.string "at POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Can I buy a win? No? Ugh.$"

Route104_Text_CindyIntro:
	.string "Oh golly, what is this peasant\n"
	.string "doing in my social bubble.\p"
	.string "Servants!$"

Route104_Text_CindyDefeat:
	.string "Plebeian power prevails!$"

Route104_Text_CindyPostBattle:
	.string "It wouldn't hurt to keep on\n"
	.string "indulging in the lives and\l"
	.string "behaviors of the lower class\l"
	.string "from time to time.\p"
	.string "As an exception, you are allowed\n"
	.string "to engage with me again!$"

Route104_Text_CindyRegister1:
	.string "Oh, the peasant again.\p"
	.string "Fine. Register me. Tell your friends you\n"
	.string "know me.$"

Route104_Text_CindyRegister2:
	.string "Oh, the peasant again.\p"
	.string "Fine. Register me. Tell your friends you\n"
	.string "know me.$"

Route104_Text_CindyRematchIntro:
	.string "The peasant returns! Servants, prepare\n"
	.string "my POKéMON!$"

Route104_Text_CindyRematchDefeat:
	.string "Oh, my… Beaten by the lower class.\n"
	.string "Again.$"

Route104_Text_CindyPostRematch:
	.string "“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\p"
	.string "Good-bye, peasant. Wipe your feet next\n"
	.string "time.$"

Route104_Text_DarianIntro:
	.string "I fished up a tough-looking POKéMON!\p"
	.string "It has a magical quality! It surely\n"
	.string "looks tough!$"

Route104_Text_DarianDefeat:
	.string "What the… My line snapped. And my pride.$"

Route104_Text_DarianPostBattle:
	.string "MAGIKARP… You don't live up to your\n"
	.string "name.\p"
	.string "Magic? Carp? Neither.$"

Route105_Text_FosterIntro:
	.string "There's supposed to be a mystical rock\n"
	.string "around here.\p"
	.string "Have you seen it? It's rock-shaped.$"

Route105_Text_FosterDefeated:
	.string "I was thinking about rocks while my\n"
	.string "POKéMON were weak…$"

Route105_Text_FosterPostBattle:
	.string "I can stare at a nice rock for hours.\p"
	.string "My wife says I stare at her like that. I\n"
	.string "don't.$"

Route105_Text_LuisIntro:
	.string "Whew! I thought you were drowning!\p"
	.string "You're fine? Then battle me!$"

Route105_Text_LuisDefeated:
	.string "Glub… Glub… Help…$"

Route105_Text_LuisPostBattle:
	.string "If you're drowning, wave one arm toward\n"
	.string "the beach.\p"
	.string "Not both. Then people think you're\n"
	.string "saying hi.$"

Route105_Text_DominikIntro:
	.string "Swimming in the deep blue sea!\p"
	.string "Why is it blue? Don't ask me.$"

Route105_Text_DominikDefeated:
	.string "I lost… Now I'm blue…$"

Route105_Text_DominikPostBattle:
	.string "Why is the sea blue?\p"
	.string "The MUSEUM in SLATEPORT explains it.\p"
	.string "I fell asleep during the explanation.$"

Route105_Text_BeverlyIntro:
	.string "In the water my body feels lighter!\p"
	.string "Like I've lost weight! I haven't. But it\n"
	.string "feels like it!$"

Route105_Text_BeverlyDefeated:
	.string "I'm floating… in defeat…$"

Route105_Text_PostBattle:
	.string "In water, you weigh only a tenth of your\n"
	.string "weight.\p"
	.string "So I'm… Whoops! Nice try! I'm not telling\n"
	.string "you my weight!$"

Route105_Text_ImaniIntro:
	.string "The blue sky… The vast sea… So\n"
	.string "peaceful…\p"
	.string "Why are you here? Leave.$"

Route105_Text_ImaniDefeated:
	.string "I lost while lounging!$"

Route105_Text_ImaniPostBattle:
	.string "I want people to say I'm relaxing to be\n"
	.string "around.\p"
	.string "Nobody has said it yet.$"

Route105_Text_AndresIntro:
	.string "The sea keeps secrets from us.\p"
	.string "Like my wife.$"

Route105_Text_AndresDefeated:
	.string "Yes… I'm bad at battling…$"

Route105_Text_AndresPostBattle:
	.string "There are many secrets in the sea.\p"
	.string "I'll find them all. Starting with her\n"
	.string "phone password.$"

Route105_Text_AndresRegister:
	.string "You'd register someone as weak as me?\p"
	.string "…Thank you. Nobody ever does.$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchIntro:
	.string "I'm still weak. Are you sure?$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchDefeated:
	.string "Yes… As expected.$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchPostBattle:
	.string "I'm weak at battling, but I'll explore\n"
	.string "every sea!\p"
	.string "With a lifejacket. And floaties.$"

Route105_Text_JosueIntro:
	.string "I'm exhausted from swimming.\p"
	.string "I'm a BIRD KEEPER. Why am I in the sea?!$"

Route105_Text_JosueDefeated:
	.string "I lost because I'm at sea!$"

Route105_Text_JosuePostBattle:
	.string "The sky suits me better than the sea.\p"
	.string "My BIRD POKéMON won't carry me, though.\n"
	.string "Rude.$"

Route106_Text_ElliotIntro:
	.string "Sea fishing or stream fishing?\p"
	.string "Wrong answer. Both.$"

Route106_Text_ElliotDefeated:
	.string "I lost spectacularly! Like my last\n"
	.string "marriage!$"

Route106_Text_ElliotPostBattle:
	.string "Fishing is great anywhere. Right?\n"
	.string "Right?!$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRegister:
	.string "Fishing's great, and so is battling.\p"
	.string "Let's meet again. I'll bring bait.$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchIntro:
	.string "I fished up a whole new team! Watch\n"
	.string "this!$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchDefeated:
	.string "Lost spectacularly! Again!$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Win or lose, POKéMON are great. And fish.\n"
	.string "Fish are also great.$"

Route106_Text_NedIntro:
	.string "What if I hook a big one while I'm in the\n"
	.string "washroom?\p"
	.string "So I don't go.\p"
	.string "I haven't gone in two days.$"

Route106_Text_NedDefeated:
	.string "I lost because I'm holding it in…$"

Route106_Text_NedPostBattle:
	.string "Oh, no! I feel a big one coming!\p"
	.string "In the water or in me? Both?!$"

Route106_Text_DouglasIntro:
	.string "Hahah! I'm a lousy runner, but in the\n"
	.string "water nobody catches me!$"

Route106_Text_DouglasDefeated:
	.string "I give up! I'm swimming home!$"

Route106_Text_DouglasPostBattle:
	.string "I'd never lose a swim race.\p"
	.string "I'd lose a running race to a SLAKOTH,\n"
	.string "though.$"

Route106_Text_KylaIntro:
	.string "The sea is my backyard!\p"
	.string "I won't go easy on you just because\n"
	.string "you're a kid!$"

Route106_Text_KylaDefeated:
	.string "Did you go easy on me?!$"

Route106_Text_KylaPostBattle:
	.string "Drifting with the waves… I love it!\p"
	.string "I once drifted to DEWFORD by accident.\n"
	.string "Two days.$"

Route107_Text_DarrinIntro:
	.string "Yawn… I fell asleep in the water again.\p"
	.string "Look at my fingers! Like raisins! Is\n"
	.string "that normal after six days?$"

Route107_Text_DarrinDefeated:
	.string "Ahaha, I lost…\p"
	.string "I'll take a snooze. Day seven.$"

Route107_Text_DarrinPostBattle:
	.string "Floating on the waves is like a plush\n"
	.string "bed.\p"
	.string "A wet, salty, never-ending bed.$"

Route107_Text_TonyIntro:
	.string "The sea is my backyard! Let's battle!$"

Route107_Text_TonyDefeated:
	.string "I lost on my home turf… I'm in shock!$"

Route107_Text_TonyPostBattle:
	.string "I swim the seas with a heart full of\n"
	.string "dreams…\p"
	.string "It's a song I wrote. It has one line.$"

Route107_Text_TonyRegister:
	.string "You shocked me! So you won't forget me,\n"
	.string "let's register.$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchIntro:
	.string "The big sea made my POKéMON stronger!$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchDefeated:
	.string "My POKéMON got stronger, but I stayed\n"
	.string "weak!$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "The waves taught me a lot.\p"
	.string "Mostly how to spit out seawater.$"

Route107_Text_DeniseIntro:
	.string "Do you know a little town called\n"
	.string "DEWFORD?\p"
	.string "The gossip there! Oh, the gossip!$"

Route107_Text_DeniseDefeated:
	.string "I hate this! I hate you! I hate water!$"

Route107_Text_DenisePostBattle:
	.string "There's a weird saying trending in\n"
	.string "DEWFORD HALL.\p"
	.string "And a weirder rumor about the burlesque\n"
	.string "man.$"

Route107_Text_BethIntro:
	.string "You want to battle me? Sure!$"

Route107_Text_BethDefeated:
	.string "I wasn't good enough.$"

Route107_Text_BethPostBattle:
	.string "You'll keep getting better. Me too!\p"
	.string "Me a bit slower.$"

Route107_Text_LisaIntro:
	.string "LISA: We challenge you as sister and\n"
	.string "brother!\p"
	.string "Mostly sister.$"

Route107_Text_LisaDefeated:
	.string "LISA: Whoa. You're in a different class.$"

Route107_Text_LisaPostBattle:
	.string "LISA: Do you have friends to go to the\n"
	.string "beach with?\p"
	.string "I have my brother. Against my will.$"

Route107_Text_LisaNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "LISA: Want to battle us? Bring more\n"
	.string "POKéMON. Two, minimum.$"

Route107_Text_RayIntro:
	.string "RAY: Me and my sister always battle.\p"
	.string "I always lose. But together we'll beat\n"
	.string "you!$"

Route107_Text_RayDefeated:
	.string "RAY: Wowee, you're way stronger!$"

Route107_Text_RayPostBattle:
	.string "RAY: My sister gave me my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It was her least favorite one.$"

Route107_Text_RayNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "RAY: Yeah! Bring more POKéMON, loser!$"

Route107_Text_CamronIntro:
	.string "I'm in the middle of a triathlon! I'm not\n"
	.string "tired at all!$"

Route107_Text_CamronDefeated:
	.string "That drained me… I'll float here for a\n"
	.string "bit.$"

Route107_Text_CamronPostBattle:
	.string "I still have to swim AND run.\p"
	.string "Am I going to be okay? Be honest.$"

Route108_Text_JeromeIntro:
	.string "My dream is to swim all seven seas!$"

Route108_Text_JeromeDefeated:
	.string "I won't make it past sea one like this…$"

Route108_Text_JeromePostBattle:
	.string "Playing with water POKéMON is the best\n"
	.string "part of swimming!\p"
	.string "The TENTACOOL disagree.$"

Route108_Text_MatthewIntro:
	.string "Ahoy! Going to the ABANDONED SHIP too?\p"
	.string "I heard it's haunted. And damp.$"

Route108_Text_MatthewDefeated:
	.string "I'm sinking! Glub… Glub…$"

Route108_Text_MatthewPostBattle:
	.string "Some people even go inside the\n"
	.string "ABANDONED SHIP.\p"
	.string "They come out… different.$"

Route108_Text_TaraIntro:
	.string "My liar of a boyfriend says I look great\n"
	.string "in a bikini…$"

Route108_Text_TaraDefeated:
	.string "Oh, boo! My hair's wet for nothing!$"

Route108_Text_TaraPostBattle:
	.string "Even if it's a lie, I love hearing it.\p"
	.string "We're getting married. The lie was that\n"
	.string "good.$"

Route108_Text_MissyIntro:
	.string "I love the sea! I forget all my worries\n"
	.string "when I swim!$"

Route108_Text_MissyDefeated:
	.string "Now I have a new worry! You!$"

Route108_Text_MissyPostBattle:
	.string "Swim away your stress! So healthy!\p"
	.string "Unless there's a SHARPEDO. Then swim\n"
	.string "faster.$"

Route108_Text_CoryIntro:
	.string "I love WATER-type POKéMON! I love all\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I LOVE YELLING!$"

Route108_Text_CoryDefeated:
	.string "Waaah! I lost! WAAAH!$"

Route108_Text_CoryPostBattle:
	.string "Yelling is good for me!\p"
	.string "The fish hate it.$"

Route108_Text_CoryRegister:
	.string "I love tough TRAINERS! REGISTER ME!$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchIntro:
	.string "WIN OR LOSE, I LOVE BATTLING AT SEA!$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchDefeated:
	.string "WAAAH! AGAIN! WAAAH!$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Facing a challenge? Yell at the sea!\p"
	.string "The sea never yells back. That's why I\n"
	.string "love it.$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaIntro:
	.string "I'm proud of my POKéMON! This will be one\n"
	.string "speedy battle!$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaDefeated:
	.string "That wasn't cute at all. Zero stars.$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaPostBattle:
	.string "Since I'm at sea like this…\p"
	.string "I wouldn't mind putting on a pink, frilly\n"
	.string "swimsuit.\p"
	.string "The frillier the better.$"

Route109_Text_DavidIntro:
	.string "Hiyah! Look at my abs! That's what they\n"
	.string "call “cut”!$"

Route109_Text_DavidDefeated:
	.string "Aiyah! Flubbed out!$"

Route109_Text_DavidPostBattle:
	.string "Hiyah!\p"
	.string "My abs have nothing to do with POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I just wanted you to see them.$"

Route109_Text_AliceIntro:
	.string "Are you wearing sunscreen?\p"
	.string "SPF 50. Minimum. I'm not joking.$"

Route109_Text_AliceDefeated:
	.string "Ouch, ouch, ouch! Jellyfish! No, just\n"
	.string "you!$"

Route109_Text_AlicePostBattle:
	.string "Cheeks burn first!\p"
	.string "Both kinds. Trust me.$"

Route109_Text_HueyIntro:
	.string "I've docked in ports all over the world.\p"
	.string "SLATEPORT's the best. The cheapest\n"
	.string "beer.$"

Route109_Text_HueyDefeated:
	.string "You're the best! Aye! Let me buy you a\n"
	.string "rum!$"

Route109_Text_HueyPostBattle:
	.string "Best port, best beer, best TRAINER…\p"
	.string "Where's my boat? I forgot where I\n"
	.string "parked.$"

Route109_Text_EdmondIntro:
	.string "Urrrrppp…\p"
	.string "WHO'S IN CHARGE?!\p"
	.string "ME OR THE DEVIL?!$"

Route109_Text_EdmondDefeated:
	.string "FUCK!\p"
	.string "You fucking CUNT!\p"
	.string "…Not you. My POKéMON.$"

Route109_Text_EdmondPostBattle:
	.string "Darts is just POKéMON for pubs.\p"
	.string "Pick a target, throw, pray for a critical\n"
	.string "hit.\p"
	.string "Treble twenty is basically a crit.$"

Route109_Text_RickyIntro:
	.string "I'm thirsty… I want a SODA POP from the\n"
	.string "SEASHORE HOUSE…$"

Route109_Text_RickyDefeated:
	.string "Groan… My floatie popped.$"

Route109_Text_RickyPostBattle:
	.string "I'm starving… My inner tube looks like a\n"
	.string "doughnut…\p"
	.string "CHOMP! …It's not a doughnut.$"

Route109_Text_RickyRegister:
	.string "Battle me again when I'm not hungry. So\n"
	.string "never.$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchIntro:
	.string "I'm hungry, but I've got pep!$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchDefeated:
	.string "I lost… Because I'm hungry…$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Food on the beach tastes better.\p"
	.string "Sand adds crunch.$"

Route109_Text_LolaIntro:
	.string "Doesn't a beach umbrella look like a\n"
	.string "giant flower?\p"
	.string "My TATSUGIRI think so too. All three of\n"
	.string "them.$"

Route109_Text_LolaDefeated:
	.string "MOMMY! The mean kid beat me!$"

Route109_Text_LolaPostBattle:
	.string "From the sky, the beach looks like a\n"
	.string "flower garden!\p"
	.string "I'll never see it. I can't fly.$"

Route109_Text_LolaRegister:
	.string "Me? I'm here every day! Mommy leaves me\n"
	.string "here.$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchIntro:
	.string "I'm not losing again! I have my inner\n"
	.string "tube!$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchDefeated:
	.string "MOMMY! The mean kid beat me AGAIN!$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchPostBattle:
	.string "With an inner tube, me and my POKéMON\n"
	.string "are way cuter!$"

Route109_Text_AustinaIntro:
	.string "I can't swim without my inner tube.\p"
	.string "But I won't lose at POKéMON!$"

Route109_Text_AustinaDefeated:
	.string "Did I lose because of my inner tube?$"

Route109_Text_AustinaPostBattle:
	.string "My inner tube is a fashion item.\p"
	.string "I wear it to school. To dinner. To bed.$"

Route109_Text_GwenIntro:
	.string "Hi, big TRAINER. Battle with me?$"

Route109_Text_GwenDefeated:
	.string "You're strong. I'm telling my\n"
	.string "sandcastle.$"

Route109_Text_GwenPostBattle:
	.string "How did you get so strong?\p"
	.string "Is it vegetables? Please say it's not\n"
	.string "vegetables.$"

Route109_Text_CarterIntro:
	.string "Wahahah! This dude is gonna catch a big\n"
	.string "one!$"

Route109_Text_CarterDefeated:
	.string "This dude just lost one… Big time.$"

Route109_Text_CarterPostBattle:
	.string "This dude thinks you're a big one.\p"
	.string "No, a big-one-to-be! Dude!$"

Route109_Text_PaulIntro:
	.string "PAUL: Ugh, a mood-breaker.\p"
	.string "We were having a moment.$"

Route109_Text_PaulDefeated:
	.string "PAUL: Well, I give up. Honey, can we go\n"
	.string "back to the hotel?$"

Route109_Text_PaulPostBattle:
	.string "PAUL: Don't tell anyone we're here.\p"
	.string "My wife thinks I'm fishing.$"

Route109_Text_PaulNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "PAUL: We're deeply in love. So our\n"
	.string "POKéMON battle together.\p"
	.string "Bring two POKéMON.$"

Route109_Text_MelIntro:
	.string "MEL: We're, like, totally in love!\p"
	.string "Our romance is heating up all of HOENN!$"

Route109_Text_MelDefeated:
	.string "MEL: We lost! It's my fault! PAUL will\n"
	.string "hate me!$"

Route109_Text_MelPostBattle:
	.string "MEL: PAUL, are you angry?\p"
	.string "PAUL? Why is your phone buzzing? Who's\n"
	.string "“Fishing Buddy”?$"

Route109_Text_MelNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "MEL: We're, like, deeply in love. So our\n"
	.string "POKéMON battle together.\p"
	.string "Bring two!$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerIntro:
	.string "Tadaah! See? My inner tube is round!$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerDefeated:
	.string "Oh, oh! Too bad!$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerPostBattle:
	.string "I showed you my round inner tube and\n"
	.string "everything…\p"
	.string "Nobody appreciates roundness.$"

Route109_Text_HaileyIntro:
	.string "I can't swim, so I'm pretending to swim.\p"
	.string "Look. Splash! Splash!$"

Route109_Text_HaileyDefeated:
	.string "I knew it! We couldn't win.$"

Route109_Text_HaileyPostBattle:
	.string "When I learn to swim, my POKéMON will get\n"
	.string "tougher.\p"
	.string "That's how it works. I think.$"

Route109_Text_ElijahIntro:
	.string "For a guy as macho as me, BIRD POKéMON\n"
	.string "are perfect!\p"
	.string "Tweet tweet. Macho.$"

Route109_Text_ElijahDefeated:
	.string "I'm cool even in defeat, right?$"

Route109_Text_ElijahPostBattle:
	.string "For a macho guy like me, a port is\n"
	.string "perfect!\p"
	.string "I'm off to SLATEPORT. To buy seeds for\n"
	.string "my birds.$"

Route110_Text_JacobIntro:
	.string "My rental bike is three minutes over\n"
	.string "time! Let's make this QUICK!$"

Route110_Text_JacobDefeated:
	.string "My brakes failed! That's another 20\n"
	.string "POKéDOLLARS late fee…$"

Route110_Text_JacobPostBattle:
	.string "Inspect your BIKE!\p"
	.string "I didn't. That's 40 POKéDOLLARS now.$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyIntro:
	.string "Can you keep up? I take vitamins.\n"
	.string "Special vitamins. Seven of them.$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyDefeated:
	.string "Crash and burn! Please don't test my\n"
	.string "blood.$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyPostBattle:
	.string "Speed alone won't win.\p"
	.string "Neither will the vitamins, apparently.$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminIntro:
	.string "Wie döt mij wat, wie döt mij wat, wie döt\n"
	.string "mij wat vandage?\l"
	.string "'k Heb de banden vol met wind, nee ik heb\l"
	.string "ja niks te klagen!\p"
	.string "…Sorry, Dutch song. Whenever I ride, I\n"
	.string "can't help myself. Op fietse!$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminDefeated:
	.string "Lekke band… That's Dutch for “I lost.”$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminPostBattle:
	.string "Rustig aan.\p"
	.string "That's Dutch for “take it easy.”\n"
	.string "There's plenty of time.$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRegister:
	.string "Rustig aan. No stress.\p"
	.string "Register me and give me a shout. In\n"
	.string "Dutch, preferably.$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchIntro:
	.string "Ik wil fietsen, fietsen, fietsen!\p"
	.string "…Don't look at me like that. Cycling IS\n"
	.string "Dutch. Let's battle!$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchDefeated:
	.string "Tegenwind… Always tegenwind.$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Rustig aan.\p"
	.string "That's Dutch for “take it easy.”\n"
	.string "There's plenty of time.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailIntro:
	.string "Hold on, let me pause my STRAVA.\p"
	.string "…Actually, no, keep it running. This\n"
	.string "battle counts as interval training.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailDefeated:
	.string "My average speed! Ruined! 400 kudos,\n"
	.string "gone!$"

Route110_Text_AbigailPostBattle:
	.string "I need a rest.\p"
	.string "Rest days don't get kudos, though.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRegister:
	.string "Let's have a rematch on CYCLING ROAD!\p"
	.string "I'll upload it to STRAVA.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchIntro:
	.string "I have 1,200 followers on STRAVA and\n"
	.string "zero friends. Let's battle, I need a new\l"
	.string "segment record.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchDefeated:
	.string "If it's not on STRAVA, it didn't happen.\n"
	.string "So this didn't happen.$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchPostBattle:
	.string "Were you going for a record?\p"
	.string "Sorry. I was going for a selfie.$"

Route110_Text_JasmineIntro:
	.string "Clip-in pedals! Very pro, very fast.\p"
	.string "I just can't get my feet out of them. So\n"
	.string "I can't stop. Ever. Let's battle while I\l"
	.string "roll!$"

Route110_Text_JasmineDefeated:
	.string "Help… I'm tipping over… very… slowly…$"

Route110_Text_JasminePostBattle:
	.string "You have GYM BADGES? No wonder.\p"
	.string "Could you unclip me? Please?$"

Route110_Text_EdwardIntro:
	.string "I have foreseen your intentions! The\n"
	.string "cards never lie!$"

Route110_Text_EdwardDefeated:
	.string "The cards lied!$"

Route110_Text_EdwardPostBattle:
	.string "I see your future… A shining light… No,\n"
	.string "wait, that's the sun.$"

Route110_Text_JaclynIntro:
	.string "Ahahaha! Mercury is in retrograde!\n"
	.string "You're doomed!$"

Route110_Text_JaclynDefeated:
	.string "I should've checked my horoscope first.$"

Route110_Text_JaclynPostBattle:
	.string "You only won because Venus was in your\n"
	.string "house!\p"
	.string "Don't think it'll happen again!$"

Route110_Text_EdwinIntro:
	.string "Could I see your POKéMON?\p"
	.string "Just one look?\p"
	.string "…Just one touch?$"

Route110_Text_EdwinDefeated:
	.string "My collection… incomplete…$"

Route110_Text_EdwinPostBattle:
	.string "When I see a POKéMON I don't know, my\n"
	.string "passion ignites!\p"
	.string "The police call it something else.$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRegister:
	.string "I also collect MATCH CALL\n"
	.string "registrations…\p"
	.string "I have 4,000. Most blocked me.$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchIntro:
	.string "Caught any new POKéMON? Could I see\n"
	.string "them? Just one look?$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchDefeated:
	.string "Your POKéMON… I envy you.$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchPostBattle:
	.string "I long to own every rare POKéMON!\p"
	.string "And your hat. Is that hat for sale?$"

Route110_Text_DaleIntro:
	.string "Hey! Don't sneak up on me!\p"
	.string "You scared the fish. And me.$"

Route110_Text_DaleDefeated:
	.string "I lost! Drat!$"

Route110_Text_DalePostBattle:
	.string "Fishing is all about concentration.\p"
	.string "Focus on the float.\p"
	.string "…What were we talking about?$"

Route110_Text_IsabelIntro:
	.string "Ahahaha! I'd go anywhere to show off my\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

Route110_Text_IsabelDefeated:
	.string "Oh, dear, this won't do. This won't do at\n"
	.string "all.$"

Route110_Text_IsabelPostBattle:
	.string "Maybe I should show off my POKéMON at\n"
	.string "the FAN CLUB instead.\p"
	.string "They have to clap. It's in the rules.$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRegister:
	.string "That wasn't even close to my best\n"
	.string "showing off.\p"
	.string "You'll be my captive audience!$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchIntro:
	.string "Ahahaha! Showing off time!$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchDefeated:
	.string "Oh, dear, this still won't do.$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchPostBattle:
	.string "I'll never stop showing off my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "My family blocked me on everything.$"

Route110_Text_TimmyIntro:
	.string "I WANNA BE THE VERY BEST, LIKE NO ONE\n"
	.string "EVER WAS!$"

Route110_Text_TimmyDefeated:
	.string "…Like no one ever was. Especially not\n"
	.string "today.$"

Route110_Text_TimmyPostBattle:
	.string "It's hard to be the best with POKéMON\n"
	.string "you just caught.\p"
	.string "To catch them is my real test.$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaIntro:
	.string "I fell off CYCLING ROAD…\p"
	.string "Well, my CYCLIZAR fell off. I was on\n"
	.string "it. Physics handled the rest.\p"
	.string "I'll get over the embarrassment by\n"
	.string "battling you!$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaDefeated:
	.string "Oops! Lost that too!$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaPostBattle:
	.string "Falling… Losing…\p"
	.string "There's a video. 2 million views.\n"
	.string "The CYCLIZAR got a fan club.\p"
	.string "I got a meme. With a sound effect.$"

Route110_Text_JosephIntro:
	.string "Love forever, love is free\n"
	.string "Let's turn forever, you and me\p"
	.string "Windmill, windmill for the land\n"
	.string "Is everybody in?$"

Route110_Text_JosephDefeated:
	.string "HA-HA-HA-HA-HAAAA!$"

Route110_Text_JosephPostBattle:
	.string "Losing made me a better man!\p"
	.string "Windmill, windmill for the land…$"

Route110_Text_KalebIntro:
	.string "When cute POKéMON help each other…\p"
	.string "My heart! I can't!$"

Route110_Text_KalebDefeated:
	.string "Have you no compassion?!$"

Route110_Text_KalebPostBattle:
	.string "Okay, okay, you did your best, my\n"
	.string "pretties.\p"
	.string "Daddy's not mad. Daddy's crying.$"

Route111_Text_DrewIntro:
	.string "Nice GO-GOGGLES! They'd look better on\n"
	.string "me, though.\p"
	.string "Let's battle for it!$"

Route111_Text_DrewDefeat:
	.string "I couldn't see anything at my sides with\n"
	.string "these GO-GOGGLES.$"

Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle:
	.string "The GO-GOGGLES get me through\n"
	.string "sandstorms.\p"
	.string "Also, they hide my tears.$"

Route111_Text_HeidiIntro:
	.string "I'm having a picnic in the desert!\p"
	.string "There's sand in everything. The\n"
	.string "sandwich is now a SANDwich.$"

Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat:
	.string "Ohhh! You're mean! Sand in my\n"
	.string "everything!$"

Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle:
	.string "In a sandstorm, watch your POKéMON's\n"
	.string "HP.\p"
	.string "And your eyes. And your ears. Sand gets\n"
	.string "everywhere.$"

Route111_Text_BeauIntro:
	.string "These GO-GOGGLES make me feel like a\n"
	.string "superhero!\p"
	.string "Nobody can beat me!$"

Route111_Text_BeauDefeat:
	.string "I can't win on spirit alone… I need\n"
	.string "POKéMON too.$"

Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle:
	.string "I'll be a real hero one day.\p"
	.string "I already have the goggles. Next: a\n"
	.string "cape.$"

Route111_Text_BeckyIntro:
	.string "There are fossils in this desert. Where\n"
	.string "are they?$"

Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat:
	.string "I came up short. Like my water supply.$"

Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle:
	.string "If there are fossils here, this was once\n"
	.string "a sea.\p"
	.string "It'll be a sea again if AQUA gets their\n"
	.string "way.$"

Route111_Text_DustyIntro:
	.string "For thirty years I've searched for\n"
	.string "ancient ruins!\p"
	.string "I am to be challenged?$"

Route111_Text_DustyDefeat:
	.string "I searched for ruins, not for strong\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle:
	.string "Thirty years I've searched!\p"
	.string "Or forty? Which was it?$"

Route111_Text_DustyRegister:
	.string "I don't search for tough POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But I do like POKéNAVS.$"

Route111_Text_DustyRematchIntro:
	.string "Thirty years of searching for ruins!\p"
	.string "Or forty? Anyway, battle!$"

Route111_Text_DustyRematchDefeat:
	.string "No ruins. No strong POKéMON.$"

Route111_Text_DustyPostRematch:
	.string "Thirty years… Forty? Fifty?\p"
	.string "How long have I been at this?\p"
	.string "What year is it?$"

Route111_Text_TravisIntro:
	.string "I'm full of pep! My POKéMON too! We had\n"
	.string "six coffees!$"

Route111_Text_TravisDefeat:
	.string "My POKéMON lost its pep… The crash is\n"
	.string "here…$"

Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle:
	.string "When I see a TRAINER with pep, I can't\n"
	.string "look away.\p"
	.string "My heart is racing. Is that normal?$"

Route111_Text_IreneIntro:
	.string "I don't know where you're going, but\n"
	.string "want to battle?$"

Route111_Text_IreneDefeat:
	.string "Oh, you're disgustingly good! Gross!$"

Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle:
	.string "I should go to MT. CHIMNEY…\p"
	.string "But the view here is nice too. Sand. More\n"
	.string "sand.$"

Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro:
	.string "A GREAT SLAM AND THEN SOME!$"

Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat:
	.string "KNOCKOUT!$"

Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle:
	.string "I once made a deal with the DEVIL. KING\n"
	.string "DICE said the contract was just a\l"
	.string "formality.\p"
	.string "Now I owe them my soul and a weekly\n"
	.string "payment. Never sign anything in a\l"
	.string "casino, kid.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonIntro:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker… My name… CHARLES.\p"
	.string "I wanted to get the attention of a girl\n"
	.string "I like, so I learned a new style of\l"
	.string "battling.\p"
	.string "INVERSE BATTLES. Everything is upside\n"
	.string "down.\p"
	.string "Like my love life.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat:
	.string "She still won't look at me…$"

Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle:
	.string "In an inverse battle, weaknesses\n"
	.string "become strengths.\p"
	.string "I'm hoping the same goes for me.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRegister:
	.string "You get inverse battles.\p"
	.string "Maybe you can help me get her.\p"
	.string "Let's register each other.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRematchIntro:
	.string "It's me. CHARLES. The heartbreaker.\p"
	.string "She blocked me. Everywhere.\p"
	.string "So I'm still battling upside down.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRematchDefeat:
	.string "Upside down, inside out…\p"
	.string "Still single.$"

Route111_Text_WiltonPostRematch:
	.string "One day she'll notice me.\p"
	.string "Until then: inverse battles and sad\n"
	.string "songs.$"

Route111_Text_BrookeIntro:
	.string "Your POKéMON look like serious actors.\p"
	.string "I'd like to book them for an engagement.$"

Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat:
	.string "They don't just look strong, they are\n"
	.string "strong!$"

Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle:
	.string "I thought I trained my POKéMON well.\p"
	.string "There's still so much to do. So much.$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRegister:
	.string "I wish I had more strong friends like\n"
	.string "you!\p"
	.string "Or any friends.$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRematchIntro:
	.string "Moves make POKéMON strong or weak.\p"
	.string "What do your POKéMON know?$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRematchDefeat:
	.string "You taught them good moves!$"

Route111_Text_BrookePostRematch:
	.string "Maybe I should've stopped my POKéMON\n"
	.string "from evolving until they learned better\l"
	.string "moves…\p"
	.string "Too late now. They're huge.$"

Route111_Text_CeliaIntro:
	.string "I shouldn't have come here for a picnic!$"

Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat:
	.string "Aww! I really shouldn't have come!$"

Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle:
	.string "In this sandstorm, I can't even set the\n"
	.string "table.\p"
	.string "The plates are gone. The table too.$"

Route111_Text_BryanIntro:
	.string "How tough are you? We shall expose that\n"
	.string "secret!$"

Route111_Text_BryanDefeat:
	.string "Your strength! Shrouded in mystery!$"

Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle:
	.string "This desert hoards mysteries in its\n"
	.string "shifting sands!\p"
	.string "And my car keys.$"

Route111_Text_BrandenIntro:
	.string "I'll give you half my sandwich if you\n"
	.string "lose.$"

Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat:
	.string "Tch! Not even a sandwich could bribe\n"
	.string "you…$"

Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle:
	.string "My POKéMON love my sandwiches.\p"
	.string "I don't get any. It's fine.$"

Route111_Text_TyronIntro:
	.string "This is my favorite kind of POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Look at them! LOOK!$"

Route111_Text_TyronDefeat:
	.string "Wait! Did you even look at my POKéMON?$"

Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle:
	.string "I love showing off my POKéMON in battle.\p"
	.string "You didn't look. I noticed.$"

Route111_Text_CelinaIntro:
	.string "LET'S GROOVE TONIGHT! Share the spice\n"
	.string "of life!$"

Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat:
	.string "…Baby, slice it right…$"

Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle:
	.string "My pulse is still racing.\p"
	.string "Let this groove get you to move!$"

Route111_Text_HaydenIntro:
	.string "I'm starving! No room for pity!$"

Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat:
	.string "Groan… The desert is not for me.$"

Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle:
	.string "My stomach is growling!\p"
	.string "Maybe I'll grill some BERRIES. Or a\n"
	.string "PIDGEY. Kidding. Mostly.$"

Route111_Text_BiancaIntro:
	.string "Did you come from MAUVILLE? You must\n"
	.string "be full of energy!$"

Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat:
	.string "Ooh lala! That's a lot to take!$"

Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle:
	.string "This road… You have a long way to go.\p"
	.string "I'd give you water, but I drank it all.$"

Route112_Text_BriceIntro:
	.string "HYUCK HYUCK HYUCK!\p"
	.string "How about a battle? You and me!\p"
	.string "HYUCK HYUCK HYUCK!$"

Route112_Text_BriceDefeat:
	.string "Hyuck… hyuck…$"

Route112_Text_BricePostBattle:
	.string "HYUCK HYUCK HYUCK!\p"
	.string "I laugh even when I lose!\p"
	.string "HYUCK!$"

Route112_Text_TrentIntro:
	.string "My legs are solid from pounding these\n"
	.string "mountains!\p"
	.string "They won't buckle easily!$"

Route112_Text_TrentDefeat:
	.string "Ouch! My legs cramped!$"

Route112_Text_TrentPostBattle:
	.string "Try hiking with a pack of dozens of\n"
	.string "pounds.\p"
	.string "It'll get you in shape.\p"
	.string "Or in a hospital.$"

Route112_Text_TrentRegister:
	.string "My legs cramped… Grab me bandages from\n"
	.string "my bag?\p"
	.string "No, that's my POKéNAV! Oh, fine.\n"
	.string "Registered.$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchIntro:
	.string "I kept fit by hiking! Power in spades!$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchDefeat:
	.string "Out-powered?$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchPostBattle:
	.string "I hear the TRAINERS on MT. CHIMNEY are\n"
	.string "tough.\p"
	.string "I'll hike up there. Right after this\n"
	.string "cramp.$"

Route112_Text_LarryIntro:
	.string "I'm strong. I won't cry if I lose.$"

Route112_Text_LarryDefeat:
	.string "WAAAAAH! I want my mommy!$"

Route112_Text_LarryPostBattle:
	.string "I'm not crying because I miss my mommy!\n"
	.string "Snivel…\p"
	.string "I'm crying because I'm named LARRY and\n"
	.string "I'm not a salaryman.$"

Route112_Text_CarolIntro:
	.string "On a picnic, you have to sing! Sing with\n"
	.string "me!$"

Route112_Text_CarolDefeat:
	.string "Oh, you're so strong! It's the mountain\n"
	.string "air, right?$"

Route112_Text_CarolPostBattle:
	.string "Good or bad at singing, it doesn't\n"
	.string "matter.\p"
	.string "The most fun wins!\p"
	.string "You didn't sing. You lost the real\n"
	.string "battle.$"

Route112_Text_BryantIntro:
	.string "I caught hot POKéMON in FIERY PATH!\n"
	.string "Look!$"

Route112_Text_BryantDefeat:
	.string "What a bumpy ride!$"

Route112_Text_BryantPostBattle:
	.string "I like your battle style. It has flair.\p"
	.string "My eyebrows have less flair. They\n"
	.string "burned off.$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaIntro:
	.string "Aren't you adorable! I need a romantic\n"
	.string "battle!\p"
	.string "I'm somewhat decent! At battling. And\n"
	.string "at romance, somewhat.$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, how strong you are!$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaPostBattle:
	.string "Are you busy? We could battle again\n"
	.string "right now…\p"
	.string "No? That's fine. I'll wait. I'm good at\n"
	.string "waiting.$"

Route113_Text_JaylenIntro:
	.string "Hey! You're here too? Gramps told me\n"
	.string "about you. What a loser.$"

Route113_Text_JaylenDefeat:
	.string "WHAT? Unbelievable! I picked the wrong\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

Route113_Text_JaylenPostBattle:
	.string "I'm heading to the POKéMON LEAGUE!\p"
	.string "…After Gramps stops laughing.$"

Route113_Text_DillonIntro:
	.string "Hands up! This is a TEAM ROCKET\n"
	.string "operation!\p"
	.string "…Uniform? It's in the wash.\p"
	.string "This is my undercover look.$"

Route113_Text_DillonDefeat:
	.string "TEAM ROCKET… retreats… for now!$"

Route113_Text_DillonPostBattle:
	.string "GIOVANNI will hear about this.\p"
	.string "I sent him 400 letters. No reply yet.\p"
	.string "He's probably busy. Being evil.$"

Route113_Text_MadelineIntro:
	.string "I use this parasol to keep the filthy\n"
	.string "ash off my dear NUMEL.\p"
	.string "I don't have a NUMEL anymore. Old habit.$"

Route113_Text_MadelineDefeat:
	.string "Huff, huff… I'm exhausted…$"

Route113_Text_MadelinePostBattle:
	.string "You're very good! I'm impressed.\p"
	.string "Now excuse me, I have ash in my bra.$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRegister:
	.string "Slide under my parasol. Let's register.\p"
	.string "Closer. The ash, darling.$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRematchIntro:
	.string "Hello! It's been a while! Battle?$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRematchDefeat:
	.string "Oh, how super! Super annoying!$"

Route113_Text_MadelinePostRematch:
	.string "Still very good! I'm impressed.\p"
	.string "Still ash in my bra.$"

Route113_Text_LaoIntro:
	.string "BELIEVE IT! I'm gonna be the HOKAGE of\n"
	.string "ROUTE 113!$"

Route113_Text_LaoDefeat:
	.string "Dattebayo… I lost.$"

Route113_Text_LaoPostBattle:
	.string "I'll train until I master the RASENGAN.$"

Route113_Text_LaoRegister:
	.string "Believe it!\p"
	.string "Witness the ancient ninja art of\n"
	.string "POKéNAV registration! Dattebayo!$"

Route113_Text_LaoRematchIntro:
	.string "I NEVER go back on my word! That's my\n"
	.string "ninja way!$"

Route113_Text_LaoRematchDefeat:
	.string "SASUKE would have won…$"

Route113_Text_LaoPostRematch:
	.string "My flawless concealment failed…\p"
	.string "It's fine. I'll train with a thousand\n"
	.string "shadow clones.$"

Route113_Text_LungIntro:
	.string "You found me? OMAE WA MOU SHINDEIRU!$"

Route113_Text_LungDefeat:
	.string "NANI?!$"

Route113_Text_LungPostBattle:
	.string "Hiding is lonely. Like being the only one\n"
	.string "who read the manga.$"

Route113_Text_ToriIntro:
	.string "TORI: We collect ashes. We also battle.\p"
	.string "And our SPINDA are dizzy. All four.$"

Route113_Text_ToriDefeat:
	.string "TORI: We lost… Boring. I'm getting more\n"
	.string "ashes.$"

Route113_Text_ToriPostBattle:
	.string "TORI: How much ash do we have?\p"
	.string "Enough for a WHITE FLUTE? Or an urn?$"

Route113_Text_ToriNotEnoughMons:
	.string "TORI: We battle 2-on-2. Otherwise we\n"
	.string "lose!$"

Route113_Text_TiaIntro:
	.string "TIA: We collect ashes. We also battle.\p"
	.string "Mostly ashes.$"

Route113_Text_TiaDefeat:
	.string "TIA: We couldn't win… I'm getting more\n"
	.string "ashes.$"

Route113_Text_TiaPostBattle:
	.string "TIA: We have soooo much ash!\p"
	.string "Mom says the car is full.$"

Route113_Text_TiaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "TIA: We battle 2-on-2. Otherwise we\n"
	.string "don't win!$"

Route113_Text_CobyIntro:
	.string "Pfft, with these wings I'll flick you\n"
	.string "away!$"

Route113_Text_CobyDefeat:
	.string "A… What? Did I lose? What year is it?$"

Route113_Text_CobyPostBattle:
	.string "I don't know what to say after losing so\n"
	.string "easily…\p"
	.string "CAW? Is that a word? CAW.$"

Route113_Text_SophieIntro:
	.string "The warmth here makes me sleepy.\p"
	.string "Battle me so I stay awake.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON are ICE types. They're\n"
	.string "melting.$"

Route113_Text_SophieDefeat:
	.string "This is a dream. I'm sure of it…$"

Route113_Text_SophiePostBattle:
	.string "Losing burns me up…\p"
	.string "I'm going to sleep right here. Zzz…\p"
	.string "Wake me in spring.$"

Route113_Text_LawrenceIntro:
	.string "Were you gathering volcanic ash?\p"
	.string "Don't. It gets into places.$"

Route113_Text_LawrenceDefeat:
	.string "Ehehe. Beaten cleanly. Unlike my\n"
	.string "clothes.$"

Route113_Text_LawrencePostBattle:
	.string "I should hide under the ash too.\p"
	.string "Nobody would find me. I'd like that.$"

Route113_Text_WyattIntro:
	.string "Do you play PALWORLD?\p"
	.string "…Good. Don't. It's a soulless clone.\n"
	.string "POKéMON with guns and factory shifts.\p"
	.string "I caught my POKéMON the honest way.\n"
	.string "Let's battle!$"

Route113_Text_WyattDefeat:
	.string "At least my POKéMON don't work\n"
	.string "twelve-hour shifts in a mine.$"

Route113_Text_WyattPostBattle:
	.string "You know who plays PALWORLD? People\n"
	.string "who think LUCARIO as an Egyptian dog\l"
	.string "god counts as a new idea.\p"
	.string "And that knight horse? That's COBALION\n"
	.string "in cosplay. The owl with the bow and the\l"
	.string "hood? DECIDUEYE's lawyer is on the\l"
	.string "phone.\p"
	.string "PALWORLD players, go touch grass. Real\n"
	.string "grass. With real POKéMON in it.$"

Route114_Text_LennyIntro:
	.string "Yodelayhihoo!\p"
	.string "… …\p"
	.string "You shout “yodelayhihoo” back, since it\n"
	.string "doesn't echo here!$"

Route114_Text_LennyDefeat:
	.string "Yodelayhee-HOOOO! …That's the sound\n"
	.string "of defeat.$"

Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle:
	.string "As a kid, I thought someone was copying\n"
	.string "me: “Yodelayhihoo.”\p"
	.string "It was my brother. He still does it.$"

Route114_Text_LucasIntro:
	.string "If you're not prepared, don't go up\n"
	.string "mountains!\p"
	.string "I have 14 kinds of socks with me.$"

Route114_Text_LucasDefeat:
	.string "The mountains are unforgiving… And so\n"
	.string "are you.$"

Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle:
	.string "In winter, mountains mean blizzards and\n"
	.string "avalanches.\p"
	.string "In summer, mosquitoes. Pick your poison.$"

Route114_Text_ShaneIntro:
	.string "Camping's fun! Fishing, marshmallows,\n"
	.string "spooky stories!\p"
	.string "But POKéMON battles are the best!$"

Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat:
	.string "Way too strong! I'm going back to my\n"
	.string "tent!$"

Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle:
	.string "Camping with my POKéMON is great.\p"
	.string "They eat all the marshmallows, though.$"

Route114_Text_NancyIntro:
	.string "I need to exercise after eating. Let's\n"
	.string "battle!$"

Route114_Text_NancyDefeat:
	.string "Oh, no! My picnic! My dignity!$"

Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle:
	.string "I just ate a big meal. I'm getting\n"
	.string "sleepy…\p"
	.string "Food coma. Goodnight.$"

Route114_Text_SteveIntro:
	.string "Ufufufufufu… Want to battle my\n"
	.string "POKéMON?\p"
	.string "They're… special.$"

Route114_Text_SteveDefeat:
	.string "M-my POKéMON… My precious babies…$"

Route114_Text_StevePostBattle:
	.string "A big lumpy hard body, enormous horns,\n"
	.string "vicious fangs…\p"
	.string "Ufufufu… I wish I had a POKéMON like\n"
	.string "that…\p"
	.string "Why are you backing away?$"

Route114_Text_SteveRegister:
	.string "Don't forget what you did to me!\p"
	.string "I'll make sure you can't forget. I have\n"
	.string "your number now.$"

Route114_Text_SteveRematchIntro:
	.string "Ufufufufufu… Come on, battle my\n"
	.string "POKéMON…$"

Route114_Text_SteveRematchDefeat:
	.string "I feel so lucky to see your POKéMON…$"

Route114_Text_StevePostRematch:
	.string "Ufufufufufu…\p"
	.string "When POKéMON battle, I get all shivery\n"
	.string "and shaky…\p"
	.string "That's normal. Right?$"

Route114_Text_BernieIntro:
	.string "Lighting a campfire? Keep water handy.\p"
	.string "Also, don't leave your PIDGEY next to\n"
	.string "it.$"

Route114_Text_BernieDefeat:
	.string "Thanks for putting out my fire. I've\n"
	.string "been burning for weeks.$"

Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle:
	.string "Be careful with fire in a forest.\p"
	.string "Never underestimate fire.\p"
	.string "Or hunger.$"

Route114_Text_BernieRegister:
	.string "You set my spirit on fire!\p"
	.string "And my grill. Let's register.$"

Route114_Text_BernieRematchIntro:
	.string "Remember my PIDGEY? I got hungry. Now I\n"
	.string "grow my own olives. For the oil.$"

Route114_Text_BernieRematchDefeat:
	.string "Tasted like chicken, by the way.$"

Route114_Text_BerniePostRematch:
	.string "Olive oil, PIDGEY and a forest fire.\p"
	.string "Don't underestimate a good barbecue.$"

Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro:
	.string "If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand a\n"
	.string "chance!\p"
	.string "But we're not. So bring it!$"

Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat:
	.string "If this was fishing, I'd have won…$"

Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle:
	.string "I'll try for a big one at METEOR FALLS.\p"
	.string "There has to be something in there. A\n"
	.string "meteor fish.$"

Route114_Text_NolanIntro:
	.string "I like fishing. I like battling!\p"
	.string "I'll battle anyone, even mid-fish.$"

Route114_Text_NolanDefeat:
	.string "I like battling. Doesn't mean I'm good at\n"
	.string "it…$"

Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle:
	.string "“This time I'll do it!”\p"
	.string "I always think that. That's why I can't\n"
	.string "quit fishing. Or POKéMON. Or gambling.$"

Route114_Text_TyraIntro:
	.string "TYRA: Sure, I'm in the mood.\p"
	.string "I'll teach you a thing or two about\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route114_Text_TyraDefeat:
	.string "TYRA: What an amazing battle style! Can\n"
	.string "we copy it?$"

Route114_Text_TyraPostBattle:
	.string "TYRA: I was teaching my junior IVY\n"
	.string "about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Lesson one: sometimes you lose. Like\n"
	.string "just now.$"

Route114_Text_TyraNotEnoughMons:
	.string "TYRA: Giggle… One POKéMON isn't enough\n"
	.string "to battle us!$"

Route114_Text_IvyIntro:
	.string "IVY: Who taught you about POKéMON?\p"
	.string "Mine was TYRA. She's the best!$"

Route114_Text_IvyDefeat:
	.string "IVY: What an amazing battle style! We're\n"
	.string "copying it!$"

Route114_Text_IvyPostBattle:
	.string "IVY: TYRA taught me everything!\p"
	.string "Maybe I need a new teacher.$"

Route114_Text_IvyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "IVY: Only one POKéMON? Isn't it lonely?$"

Route114_Text_KaiIntro:
	.string "I landed a big one! A HUGE one!\p"
	.string "Okay, three small ones. They swim\n"
	.string "together.$"

Route114_Text_KaiDefeat:
	.string "What happened? Did mine shrink?$"

Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle:
	.string "Okay! I'll fish up a bigger one!\p"
	.string "Or more small ones. Same thing.$"

Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro:
	.string "Me! I'm not just a pretty face!$"

Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat:
	.string "That wasn't cute at all!$"

Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle:
	.string "I don't want POKéMON that are just\n"
	.string "cute.\p"
	.string "I want cute ones with issues. Like my\n"
	.string "boyfriends.$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro:
	.string "Have you evolved your POKéMON a lot?$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, I see. Good to know.$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle:
	.string "Some POKéMON change so much when they\n"
	.string "evolve!\p"
	.string "My cute POLIWAG will turn into a hairy\n"
	.string "wrestler. I'm not ready.$"

Route115_Text_TimothyIntro:
	.string "Hm… You seem capable…\p"
	.string "Keep an old man company!$"

Route115_Text_TimothyDefeat:
	.string "Much stronger than I imagined!$"

Route115_Text_TimothyPostBattle:
	.string "There's no such thing as a born genius.\p"
	.string "It's all effort!\p"
	.string "And a good night's sleep. I never get\n"
	.string "one.$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRegister:
	.string "A loss this thorough… It's been ages.\p"
	.string "Allow me another chance.$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRematchIntro:
	.string "Hm… Your speed speaks for itself. Keep\n"
	.string "me company!$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRematchDefeat:
	.string "As strong as ever! Don't you ever get\n"
	.string "tired?$"

Route115_Text_TimothyPostRematch:
	.string "All it takes is effort!\p"
	.string "I lost because I didn't put in enough.\p"
	.string "I was napping.$"

Route115_Text_KoichiIntro:
	.string "You!\p"
	.string "My MACHOP!\p"
	.string "Demand a battle!\p"
	.string "…It evolved. MACHOKE. Demands a battle.$"

Route115_Text_KoichiDefeat:
	.string "Ouch, ouch, ouch! My karate chop!$"

Route115_Text_KoichiPostBattle:
	.string "My fighting crew!\p"
	.string "As long as they seek power, I'll grow\n"
	.string "with them!\p"
	.string "We also share protein shakes.$"

Route115_Text_NobIntro:
	.string "My strongest skill: busting bricks with\n"
	.string "my forehead!$"

Route115_Text_NobDefeat:
	.string "Ugwaaaah! My head is busted!$"

Route115_Text_NobPostBattle:
	.string "I teach my POKéMON karate.\p"
	.string "They'll be better than me soon.\p"
	.string "At least they still have brain cells.$"

Route115_Text_NobRegister:
	.string "You impress me!\p"
	.string "Rematch after I redo my training. And\n"
	.string "my forehead.$"

Route115_Text_NobRematchIntro:
	.string "After you beat me, we trained hard!\p"
	.string "My forehead is flat now. Rematch!$"

Route115_Text_NobRematchDefeat:
	.string "Ugwaaah! We lost again!$"

Route115_Text_NobPostRematch:
	.string "My POKéMON will get stronger!\p"
	.string "I'll double my training!\p"
	.string "And find a softer brick.$"

Route115_Text_CyndyIntro:
	.string "This beach is my secret training spot!\p"
	.string "I've trained here for ten years.\p"
	.string "Now I can hover in mid-air.\p"
	.string "Look at my feet. They're not touching\n"
	.string "the ground. Scared yet?$"

Route115_Text_CyndyDefeat:
	.string "I haven't trained enough!\p"
	.string "…I'm still hovering, though.$"

Route115_Text_CyndyPostBattle:
	.string "Everyone asks how I float.\p"
	.string "Discipline. Focus. Ten years of squats.\p"
	.string "Also, I can't get down. Please call\n"
	.string "someone.$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRegister:
	.string "Fine, you can come to my secret spot.\p"
	.string "I'll be up here. Floating. Register me.$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRematchIntro:
	.string "Still hovering! Let's battle!$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRematchDefeat:
	.string "I can hover, but my POKéMON…$"

Route115_Text_CyndyPostRematch:
	.string "Even when I lose, I enjoy it.\p"
	.string "It's the view. Everything looks better\n"
	.string "from 10 centimeters up.$"

Route115_Text_HectorIntro:
	.string "I SWALLOW SLUDGE TO TRANSFORM MYSELF!$"

Route115_Text_HectorDefeat:
	.string "I QUESTION YOUR FASHION SENSE\n"
	.string "SERIOUSLY!$"

Route115_Text_HectorPostBattle:
	.string "POUND THE THICK FAT ON MY BELLY DRUM!$"

Route115_Text_KyraIntro:
	.string "I battle while running! Keep up!$"

Route115_Text_KyraDefeat:
	.string "Gasp, gasp… I should've stuck to\n"
	.string "running…$"

Route115_Text_KyraPostBattle:
	.string "Battling while running was a mistake!\p"
	.string "I'll go for a run to calm down.$"

Route115_Text_JaidenIntro:
	.string "KAMEHAMEHAAAA!$"

Route115_Text_JaidenDefeat:
	.string "My power level wasn't over 9000…$"

Route115_Text_JaidenPostBattle:
	.string "But my POKéMON were ultra, weren't\n"
	.string "they? Like ULTRA INSTINCT?$"

Route115_Text_HeleneIntro:
	.string "My POKéMON have black belt-level\n"
	.string "strength!\p"
	.string "I have yellow belt. We're working on it.$"

Route115_Text_HeleneDefeat:
	.string "This is so humiliating! Nobody saw that,\n"
	.string "right?$"

Route115_Text_HelenePostBattle:
	.string "I rarely meet anyone better…\p"
	.string "Oh! You're a GYM LEADER in disguise,\n"
	.string "aren't you?\p"
	.string "No? Then I'm just bad. Great.$"

Route115_Text_AlixIntro:
	.string "Our eyes met! Our souls are linked now.\n"
	.string "That'll be 300 POKéDOLLARS.$"

Route115_Text_AlixDefeat:
	.string "Gah! Bad dharma!$"

Route115_Text_AlixPostBattle:
	.string "Oh, well. I'll TELEPORT home.\p"
	.string "You still owe me 300 POKéDOLLARS.$"

Route115_Text_MarleneIntro:
	.string "You've disturbed my meditation! I was\n"
	.string "halfway to the astral plane!$"

Route115_Text_MarleneDefeat:
	.string "My chakras are all over the floor now.$"

Route115_Text_MarlenePostBattle:
	.string "I was meditating.\p"
	.string "Now I'm thinking about taxes. Thanks.$"

Route116_Text_ClarkIntro:
	.string "If the tunnel doesn't go through, I'll\n"
	.string "go over the top.\p"
	.string "Hikers don't need tunnels.$"

Route116_Text_ClarkDefeat:
	.string "Gasp… Losing made me tired…$"

Route116_Text_ClarkPostBattle:
	.string "No tunnel, no problem.\p"
	.string "To a HIKER, mountains are roads.\p"
	.string "Steep, painful roads.$"

Route116_Text_JoeyIntro:
	.string "My POOCHYENA isn't like other\n"
	.string "POOCHYENA.\p"
	.string "It's in the top percentage of\n"
	.string "POOCHYENA!\p"
	.string "…All four of them are.$"

Route116_Text_JoeyDefeat:
	.string "Ouch! A scrape!\p"
	.string "My POOCHYENA are still top percentage,\n"
	.string "though!$"

Route116_Text_JoeyPostBattle:
	.string "I'll call you sometime. About POOCHYENA.\p"
	.string "They're in the top percentage, you\n"
	.string "know.$"

Route116_Text_JoseIntro:
	.string "My BUG POKéMON are tough! Let's battle!$"

Route116_Text_JoseDefeat:
	.string "I lost! I thought I had you!$"

Route116_Text_JosePostBattle:
	.string "BUG POKéMON evolve fast.\p"
	.string "Mine are still in the “crawling” phase.$"

Route116_Text_JaniceIntro:
	.string "Let me show you how strong my adorable\n"
	.string "POKéMON are!$"

Route116_Text_JaniceDefeat:
	.string "You're a notch above me… Several\n"
	.string "notches, actually.$"

Route116_Text_JanicePostBattle:
	.string "Cute AND strong. That's the dream.\p"
	.string "Mine are cute AND hungry.$"

Route116_Text_JerryIntro:
	.string "My dream is to become a salaryman like\n"
	.string "LARRY!$"

Route116_Text_JerryDefeat:
	.string "…Overtime. Again.$"

Route116_Text_JerryPostBattle:
	.string "LARRY eats at the same restaurant\n"
	.string "every day.\p"
	.string "Same order. Same face. No emotion.\p"
	.string "That's the dream.$"

Route116_Text_JerryRegister1:
	.string "LARRY says: always network.\p"
	.string "So… let's register. For my career.$"

Route116_Text_JerryRegister2:
	.string "LARRY says: always network.\p"
	.string "So… let's register. For my career.$"

Route116_Text_JerryRematchIntro:
	.string "I've been practicing my salaryman face.\p"
	.string "No emotion. See? Battle me.$"

Route116_Text_JerryRematchDefeat:
	.string "…Overtime. Unpaid.$"

Route116_Text_JerryPostRematch:
	.string "LARRY would've just sighed and gone\n"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "I'm learning.$"

Route116_Text_KarenIntro:
	.string "I study at school, and on the way home!\p"
	.string "Today's topic: FOCUS SASH.$"

Route116_Text_KarenDefeat:
	.string "I'm in shock! I lost?$"

Route116_Text_KarenPostBattle:
	.string "I'll never be an elegant TRAINER like\n"
	.string "ROXANNE this way!\p"
	.string "She's a rock star.$"

Route116_Text_KarenRegister1:
	.string "Whoa! Is that a POKéNAV? I have one\n"
	.string "too! Register me!$"

Route116_Text_KarenRegister2:
	.string "Whoa! Is that a POKéNAV? I have one\n"
	.string "too! Register me!$"

Route116_Text_KarenRematchIntro:
	.string "I studied SO much since last time! Look\n"
	.string "at my achievements!$"

Route116_Text_KarenRematchDefeat:
	.string "I'm in shock. I lost again?$"

Route116_Text_KarenPostRematch:
	.string "You beat ROXANNE? Then I can't beat\n"
	.string "you. Not yet.$"

Route116_Text_SarahIntro:
	.string "Just so you know, I've never been\n"
	.string "bested by anyone at anything.$"

Route116_Text_SarahDefeat:
	.string "Oh, my goodness. A new experience.$"

Route116_Text_SarahPostBattle:
	.string "My luxury life gives me everything I\n"
	.string "want.\p"
	.string "But with POKéMON, money means nothing.\p"
	.string "Disgusting.$"

Route116_Text_DawsonIntro:
	.string "Out of my way, peasant.\p"
	.string "Daddy's buying this route. Then the\n"
	.string "tunnel. Then you.\p"
	.string "I don't lose battles. I buy them.$"

Route116_Text_DawsonDefeat:
	.string "WHAT?! How much for that win?!\p"
	.string "…You can't buy a win? Since when?!$"

Route116_Text_DawsonPostBattle:
	.string "Scum? Me?\p"
	.string "I prefer “early investor.”\p"
	.string "Now move. You're standing on my future\n"
	.string "parking lot.$"

Route116_Text_DevanIntro:
	.string "We will, we will ROCK YOU!$"

Route116_Text_DevanDefeat:
	.string "Aiyiyi! No contest!$"

Route116_Text_DevanPostBattle:
	.string "I should try other types.\p"
	.string "My team isn't even rock types. I just\n"
	.string "like the song.$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonIntro:
	.string "Tik tok, tik tok, tik tok.$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonDefeat:
	.string "Tik… tok…\p"
	.string "Time's up.$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonPostBattle:
	.string "Every clock ticks the same.\p"
	.string "Mine doesn't.$"

Route117_Text_IsaacIntro:
	.string "Could you battle the POKéMON I'm\n"
	.string "raising?\p"
	.string "They're babies. Be gentle. Or don't.$"

Route117_Text_IsaacDefeat:
	.string "You raised yours superbly… Mine just\n"
	.string "eat and sleep.$"

Route117_Text_IsaacPostBattle:
	.string "POKéMON isn't all about power.\p"
	.string "Personality matters too.\p"
	.string "My WOBBUFFET has none. I love him\n"
	.string "anyway.$"

Route117_Text_IsaacRegister:
	.string "I'll train harder. Would you check in on\n"
	.string "us?\p"
	.string "The DAY CARE doesn't let me in anymore.$"

Route117_Text_IsaacRematchIntro:
	.string "My babies are looking good!$"

Route117_Text_IsaacRematchDefeat:
	.string "You know how to raise them. DAY\n"
	.string "CARE-level skills!$"

Route117_Text_IsaacPostRematch:
	.string "Your POKéMON look great! Enter them in\n"
	.string "CONTESTS!\p"
	.string "The moms there will hate you. It's fun.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaIntro:
	.string "Allow me to evaluate if you raised your\n"
	.string "POKéMON properly.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat:
	.string "Yes, they're growing properly.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle:
	.string "Raise your POKéMON with attention to\n"
	.string "their personality.\p"
	.string "Not just their stats. Min-maxer.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRegister:
	.string "A superb TRAINER! I hope to see you\n"
	.string "again.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRematchIntro:
	.string "Allow me to reevaluate your POKéMON.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRematchDefeat:
	.string "Growing admirably.$"

Route117_Text_LydiaPostRematch:
	.string "POKéMON like different {POKEBLOCK}S\n"
	.string "depending on their nature.\p"
	.string "Mine like fries. Don't tell anyone.$"

Route117_Text_DylanIntro:
	.string "I'm in the middle of a triathlon. Well,\n"
	.string "the middle of my knee rehab, really.\p"
	.string "My physio says no running. My physio\n"
	.string "isn't here. Let's battle!$"

Route117_Text_DylanDefeat:
	.string "Ah, my Achilles… Or my hip? Everything\n"
	.string "hurts at 38.$"

Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle:
	.string "I might have dropped to last.\p"
	.string "Also dropped my kneecap.$"

Route117_Text_DylanRegister:
	.string "POKéMON have to be strong too? Train\n"
	.string "me!\p"
	.string "My physio says I shouldn't. Register me\n"
	.string "anyway.$"

Route117_Text_DylanRematchIntro:
	.string "I'm back! New knee, same bad back. My\n"
	.string "doctor calls me “remarkably stubborn\l"
	.string "for my age.”$"

Route117_Text_DylanRematchDefeat:
	.string "I felt something pop. Don't worry,\n"
	.string "something always pops.$"

Route117_Text_DylanPostRematch:
	.string "Tops in swimming and cycling.\p"
	.string "Bottom in walking.$"

Route117_Text_MariaIntro:
	.string "I've done 14 triathlons. My body has\n"
	.string "done about 11 of them.\p"
	.string "The rest was ibuprofen.$"

Route117_Text_MariaDefeat:
	.string "My shins! Nobody ever warns you about\n"
	.string "the shins!$"

Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle:
	.string "Training only matters if you keep it up.\p"
	.string "I'll resume tomorrow. My shins say next\n"
	.string "year.$"

Route117_Text_MariaRegister:
	.string "You train properly… I'll battle you\n"
	.string "later.\p"
	.string "After my ibuprofen kicks in.$"

Route117_Text_MariaRematchIntro:
	.string "Are you keeping up with your training? I\n"
	.string "am. I'm also keeping up with my\l"
	.string "physiotherapy bills.$"

Route117_Text_MariaRematchDefeat:
	.string "I need more practice. And a new spine.$"

Route117_Text_MariaPostRematch:
	.string "Let's battle again sometime!\p"
	.string "If my spine allows it.$"

Route117_Text_DerekIntro:
	.string "Once a BUG CATCHER! Now a BUG MANIAC!\p"
	.string "My love for BUG POKéMON never changed!$"

Route117_Text_DerekDefeat:
	.string "My ineptitude never changed either…$"

Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle:
	.string "I followed my heart, and now they call\n"
	.string "me BUG MANIAC…\p"
	.string "Fair enough. I have 400 BUG POKéMON.\n"
	.string "And no girlfriend.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaIntro:
	.string "ANNA: This is my junior, MEG. I'm\n"
	.string "showing her how a senior wins.\p"
	.string "If I lose, I'm legally required to\n"
	.string "become HER junior. School rules.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaDefeat:
	.string "ANNA: MEG, look away! This is not\n"
	.string "a teachable moment!$"

Route117_Text_AnnaPostBattle:
	.string "ANNA: Our whole team glows in the\n"
	.string "dark. It's called a brand.\p"
	.string "We call it “synergy.” Our parents\n"
	.string "call it “the electricity bill.”$"

Route117_Text_AnnaAndMegRegister:
	.string "ANNA: Give me your number. I need a\n"
	.string "rematch before MEG tells everyone.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "ANNA: One POKéMON? This is a double\n"
	.string "act. Come back with a plus-one.$"

Route117_Text_MegIntro:
	.string "MEG: ANNA says watching her win is\n"
	.string "part of my education.\p"
	.string "I've watched her lose 31 times.\n"
	.string "I'm VERY educated.$"

Route117_Text_MegDefeat:
	.string "MEG: 32! I'm writing a thesis.$"

Route117_Text_MegPostBattle:
	.string "MEG: ANNA says losing builds\n"
	.string "character.\p"
	.string "She has so much character now. Too\n"
	.string "much. It's leaking.$"

Route117_Text_MegNotEnoughMons:
	.string "MEG: Only one POKéMON? ANNA says\n"
	.string "bullying is beneath her. Bring two.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchIntro:
	.string "ANNA: Rematch! I've trained MEG for\n"
	.string "months. Mostly in making excuses.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchDefeat:
	.string "ANNA: That loss was MEG's. Write it\n"
	.string "down, MEG. Under your name.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaPostRematch:
	.string "ANNA: Next time I'm bringing my own\n"
	.string "senior. MEG's grandma.\p"
	.string "She has a PIKACHU and zero mercy.$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "ANNA: Still one POKéMON? It's called\n"
	.string "a DOUBLE battle. It's in the name.$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchIntro:
	.string "MEG: I got promoted! I'm still the\n"
	.string "junior, but now with a lanyard.$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchDefeat:
	.string "MEG: They're taking the lanyard\n"
	.string "back, aren't they.$"

Route117_Text_MegPostRematch:
	.string "MEG: ANNA is writing my performance\n"
	.string "review.\p"
	.string "It's just the word “no” in a very\n"
	.string "large font.$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "MEG: One POKéMON again? ANNA says\n"
	.string "that's a cry for help. Bring two!$"

Route117_Text_MelinaIntro:
	.string "Isn't it nice? Battling while looking at\n"
	.string "pretty flowers?\p"
	.string "It's the only thing I can still do. I\n"
	.string "pulled a hamstring getting out of bed.$"

Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, that's impressive… Could you help me\n"
	.string "up?$"

Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle:
	.string "Jogging among flowers is wonderful.\p"
	.string "I've been lying here among the flowers\n"
	.string "for an hour.$"

Route117_Text_BrandiIntro:
	.string "Behold the power of my THETANS! I've\n"
	.string "been cleared!$"

Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat:
	.string "My E-METER is broken…$"

Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle:
	.string "PSYCHIC POKéMON are complex.\p"
	.string "Join us. The first course is only\n"
	.string "¥10,000.$"

Route117_Text_AishaIntro:
	.string "Focus on the win. That's how I battle!$"

Route117_Text_AishaDefeat:
	.string "I don't waste time being angry. I'd\n"
	.string "rather train.\p"
	.string "…I'm a little angry.$"

Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle:
	.string "If you worry about losing, you'll lose.\p"
	.string "So I don't worry. I still lose, though.$"

Route118_Text_RoseIntro:
	.string "The aroma of flowers has a magical\n"
	.string "power.\p"
	.string "Especially the ones I dry and roll\n"
	.string "myself.\p"
	.string "Whoa… your POKéMON have, like, auras.$"

Route118_Text_RoseDefeat:
	.string "Oh, dear me. I lost.\p"
	.string "And my lighter.$"

Route118_Text_RosePostBattle:
	.string "Flowers, POKéMON… I love whatever\n"
	.string "smells nice.\p"
	.string "Especially that one plant. You know the\n"
	.string "one.$"

Route118_Text_RoseRegister:
	.string "Sniff… That smell… A POKéNAV!\p"
	.string "Or the plant. Register me, man.$"

Route118_Text_RoseRematchIntro:
	.string "Were you drawn here by the sweet\n"
	.string "aroma?\p"
	.string "Everyone is. Sit down. Relax.$"

Route118_Text_RoseRematchDefeat:
	.string "The power of aroma… Didn't do much.\p"
	.string "Or it did a lot. Whoa.$"

Route118_Text_RosePostRematch:
	.string "Use a sweet aroma properly, and POKéMON\n"
	.string "come to you.\p"
	.string "So do the police.$"

Route118_Text_PerryIntro:
	.string "Listen closely. TAILLOW: a sharp\n"
	.string "“tsip-tsip-tsip,” like a shopping cart\l"
	.string "with ambition.\p"
	.string "WINGULL: a hoarse “kyaa-kyaa-kyaa,”\n"
	.string "the laugh of someone who just stole\l"
	.string "your fries.$"

Route118_Text_PerryDefeat:
	.string "…And that sound? That's me losing. Very\n"
	.string "common in this area.$"

Route118_Text_PerryPostBattle:
	.string "Great POKéMON.\p"
	.string "TAILLOW would say: tsip-tsip. That\n"
	.string "means “respect.”$"

Route118_Text_ChesterIntro:
	.string "AAAAAARGH! My hair turned golden and\n"
	.string "spiky! I've become a SUPER SAIYAN!$"

Route118_Text_ChesterDefeat:
	.string "…It was just hair gel.$"

Route118_Text_ChesterPostBattle:
	.string "If they got stronger, they'd fly more\n"
	.string "freely…\p"
	.string "Like my hair. Before I washed it.$"

Route118_Text_BarnyIntro:
	.string "I'm a FISHERMAN and a TRAINER. I raise\n"
	.string "what I catch.$"

Route118_Text_BarnyDefeat:
	.string "I thought my training was going fine…$"

Route118_Text_BarnyPostBattle:
	.string "Training POKéMON while fishing didn't\n"
	.string "work…\p"
	.string "Half a fisherman, half a TRAINER. Zero\n"
	.string "wins.$"

Route118_Text_WadeIntro:
	.string "For FISHERMEN, gear is key.\p"
	.string "For TRAINERS, it's POKéMON and heart!\p"
	.string "I have a lot of gear.$"

Route118_Text_WadeDefeat:
	.string "Beaten in heart?$"

Route118_Text_WadePostBattle:
	.string "Fishing is a battle between FISHERMAN\n"
	.string "and POKéMON.\p"
	.string "The POKéMON usually wins.$"

Route118_Text_DaltonIntro:
	.string "EXIT LIGHT! ENTER NIGHT!$"

Route118_Text_DaltonDefeat:
	.string "Ah, you're more of a Master of Puppets\n"
	.string "fan?$"

Route118_Text_DaltonPostBattle:
	.string "MASTER! MASTER!\p"
	.string "MASTER OF PUPPETS IS PULLING YOUR\n"
	.string "STRINGS!$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRegister:
	.string "When I learn more riffs, you have to\n"
	.string "come listen!\p"
	.string "METALLICA rules. Register me.$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRematchIntro:
	.string "Transmit the message to the receiver\n"
	.string "Hope for an answer some day\p"
	.string "I got three passports, a couple of\n"
	.string "visas\l"
	.string "You don't even know my real name$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRematchDefeat:
	.string "Message received. Loud and clear.$"

Route118_Text_DaltonPostRematch:
	.string "This ain't no party…\p"
	.string "This ain't no disco…\p"
	.string "This ain't no fooling around.$"

Route118_Text_DeandreIntro:
	.string "Go, go, go!\n"
	.string "POKéMON 1, 2, and 3!$"

Route118_Text_DeandreDefeat:
	.string "Come in, POKéMON! Are you okay?\n"
	.string "POKéMON 1, 2, and 3?!$"

Route118_Text_DeandrePostBattle:
	.string "I AM GOING TO ENJOY AN EGG$"

Route119_Text_BrentIntro:
	.string "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE! We MIMIC what\n"
	.string "you do!$"

Route119_Text_BrentDefeat:
	.string "Whoopsie! I lost!$"

Route119_Text_BrentPostBattle:
	.string "What's so good about mimicry?\p"
	.string "Fufufu… You'll never understand…$"

Route119_Text_DonaldIntro:
	.string "So, we finally meet!\p"
	.string "My BUG POKéMON will keep you company!\p"
	.string "…They're not bugs. They're DITTO.\n"
	.string "Surprise.$"

Route119_Text_DonaldDefeat:
	.string "I wish we'd never met… I'll pretend we\n"
	.string "didn't.$"

Route119_Text_DonaldPostBattle:
	.string "I want to MIMIC you more. Hurry up and\n"
	.string "move!$"

Route119_Text_TaylorIntro:
	.string "You step forward, we step forward.\p"
	.string "You turn right, we turn too…$"

Route119_Text_TaylorDefeat:
	.string "But if you win, I lose… That's how it\n"
	.string "works, huh?$"

Route119_Text_TaylorPostBattle:
	.string "I can't MIMIC you winning.\p"
	.string "That's impossible. It burns me up.$"

Route119_Text_DougIntro:
	.string "You caught me! Or were you avoiding me?$"

Route119_Text_DougDefeat:
	.string "Whoop, great match!$"

Route119_Text_DougPostBattle:
	.string "We're the MIMIC CIRCLE! Hope you\n"
	.string "enjoyed our performance.\p"
	.string "Membership is free. Leaving is not.$"

Route119_Text_GregIntro:
	.string "You don't know me. I don't know you.\p"
	.string "So we battle!$"

Route119_Text_GregDefeat:
	.string "You're pretty strong! My bugs are\n"
	.string "crying.$"

Route119_Text_GregPostBattle:
	.string "Until you leave, we'll copy your every\n"
	.string "move.\p"
	.string "Your every move.$"

Route119_Text_KentIntro:
	.string "The MIMIC CIRCLE: people who love to\n"
	.string "MIMIC.\p"
	.string "A battle starts the moment we meet!$"

Route119_Text_KentDefeat:
	.string "I give up! The rain wins, you win,\n"
	.string "everyone wins but me!$"

Route119_Text_KentPostBattle:
	.string "Join our MIMIC CIRCLE?\p"
	.string "We're definitely not a cult.$"

Route119_Text_JacksonIntro:
	.string "Who knows how to survive in the wild?\p"
	.string "POKéMON RANGERS!$"

Route119_Text_JacksonDefeat:
	.string "Not enough POKéMON know-how…$"

Route119_Text_JacksonPostBattle:
	.string "Break free from civilization! Awaken\n"
	.string "the wild spirit within!\p"
	.string "I'm going home for dinner, though.$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRegister:
	.string "Rematch me sometime. Don't laugh at my\n"
	.string "lack of knowledge.$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRematchIntro:
	.string "I'll find my wild spirit with my POKéMON!$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRematchDefeat:
	.string "You're still strong!$"

Route119_Text_JacksonPostRematch:
	.string "Believe in your POKéMON. Believe in\n"
	.string "yourself.\p"
	.string "The road will reveal itself.\p"
	.string "The tall grass won't. It snares bikes.$"

Route119_Text_CatherineIntro:
	.string "Look at you. Traveling awfully light for\n"
	.string "an adventure.$"

Route119_Text_CatherineDefeat:
	.string "Accidents happen when you're not\n"
	.string "prepared! I forgot my umbrella too.$"

Route119_Text_CatherinePostBattle:
	.string "Light, but you have everything you\n"
	.string "need.\p"
	.string "I carry 40 kilos. Just in case.$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRegister:
	.string "A POKéNAV is a must-have tool!\p"
	.string "Oh, you have one! Let's register!$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRematchIntro:
	.string "How's your journey going?$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRematchDefeat:
	.string "I'm still missing something… Talent,\n"
	.string "probably.$"

Route119_Text_CatherinePostRematch:
	.string "You rely on your POKéMON, and they rely\n"
	.string "on you.\p"
	.string "Mine mostly rely on my snacks.$"

Route119_Text_HughIntro:
	.string "I BELIEVE I CAN FLY! I BELIEVE I CAN\n"
	.string "TOUCH THE SKY!$"

Route119_Text_HughDefeat:
	.string "…I believe I can't.$"

Route119_Text_HughPostBattle:
	.string "My BIRD POKéMON made my dreams of\n"
	.string "flying come true!\p"
	.string "I still can't fly, though.$"

Route119_Text_PhilIntro:
	.string "I'll show you the true potential of me\n"
	.string "and my BIRD POKéMON!\p"
	.string "It's one POKéMON. The potential is\n"
	.string "limited.$"

Route119_Text_PhilDefeat:
	.string "We lacked potential… And a plan.$"

Route119_Text_PhilPostBattle:
	.string "Ever since I was a kid, I admired BIRD\n"
	.string "POKéMON…\p"
	.string "I once jumped off a roof. Birds make it\n"
	.string "look easy.$"

Route119_Text_YasuIntro:
	.string "100 push-ups, 100 sit-ups, 100 squats,\n"
	.string "10 km running. Every day. Let's battle.$"

Route119_Text_YasuDefeat:
	.string "…OK.$"

Route119_Text_YasuPostBattle:
	.string "I went bald for nothing.$"

Route119_Text_TakashiIntro:
	.string "I'm gonna be KING OF THE PIRATES! On\n"
	.string "ROUTE 119!$"

Route119_Text_TakashiDefeat:
	.string "My straw hat!$"

Route119_Text_TakashiPostBattle:
	.string "One day I'll find the ONE PIECE. It's\n"
	.string "probably in the tall grass.$"

Route119_Text_HideoIntro:
	.string "To hide a tree, use a forest. To hide a\n"
	.string "TITAN, use a WALL!$"

Route119_Text_HideoDefeat:
	.string "SHINZOU WO SASAGEYO… I lost.$"

Route119_Text_HideoPostBattle:
	.string "TATAKAE! …Tomorrow.$"

Route119_Text_ChrisIntro:
	.string "You spoke to me… So you want a battle!\p"
	.string "I'll use the POKéMON I caught while\n"
	.string "SURFING!$"

Route119_Text_ChrisDefeat:
	.string "I have no idea what it takes to win.$"

Route119_Text_ChrisPostBattle:
	.string "SURF on my POKéMON…\p"
	.string "Fish from its back…\p"
	.string "Indescribably luxurious. For me. Not for\n"
	.string "the POKéMON.$"

Route119_Text_FabianIntro:
	.string "Can I scream?\p"
	.string "CAN I SCREEEEAM?!$"

Route119_Text_FabianDefeat:
	.string "WE DANCE TO ALL THE WRONG SONGS! WE\n"
	.string "ENJOY ALL THE WRONG MOVES!$"

Route119_Text_FabianPostBattle:
	.string "THE SHAPE OF POKéMON TO COME!$"

Route119_Text_DaytonIntro:
	.string "Hohoho! I like kid TRAINERS! Let's have\n"
	.string "a good one!$"

Route119_Text_DaytonDefeat:
	.string "You're amazing! Hohoho!$"

Route119_Text_DaytonPostBattle:
	.string "Hohoho! I'll copy the pep of kid\n"
	.string "TRAINERS like you!\p"
	.string "The MIMIC CIRCLE is recruiting.$"

Route119_Text_RachelIntro:
	.string "It's raining again. It's gonna take a lot\n"
	.string "to drag me away from you!$"

Route119_Text_RachelDefeat:
	.string "I bless the rains down in AFRICAAAA!$"

Route119_Text_RachelPostBattle:
	.string "…This is ROUTE 119, not AFRICA. I know.\n"
	.string "Let me have this.$"

Route120_Text_ColinIntro:
	.string "Do you have moves that can hit flying\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

Route120_Text_ColinDefeat:
	.string "You soared above me! I'm grounded.$"

Route120_Text_ColinPostBattle:
	.string "FLY is convenient.\p"
	.string "While flying, almost nothing can hit it.\p"
	.string "Except THUNDER. And GUST. And TWISTER.\n"
	.string "And SKY UPPERCUT…$"

Route120_Text_RobertIntro:
	.string "My POKéMON are strong! What about\n"
	.string "yours?$"

Route120_Text_RobertDefeat:
	.string "Yours were stronger…$"

Route120_Text_RobertPostBattle:
	.string "A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\n"
	.string "you can count on.\p"
	.string "Like a savings account. With feathers.$"

Route120_Text_RobertRegister:
	.string "You'll keep getting better. Let me\n"
	.string "register you!$"

Route120_Text_RobertRematchIntro:
	.string "Steady growth! Let's see yours!$"

Route120_Text_RobertRematchDefeat:
	.string "Seriously strong.$"

Route120_Text_RobertPostRematch:
	.string "My POKéMON grow stronger. I have to\n"
	.string "grow too.\p"
	.string "I'm 1.62 m. It's not going well.$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoIntro:
	.string "Let me check if your POKéMON are fit\n"
	.string "for the outdoors.$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoDefeat:
	.string "With POKéMON like that, you won't need\n"
	.string "rescuing!$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoPostBattle:
	.string "Going wherever your heart desires with\n"
	.string "POKéMON…\p"
	.string "That's the joy of a TRAINER.\p"
	.string "And the reason I rescue so many of\n"
	.string "them.$"

Route120_Text_JennaIntro:
	.string "How's your fitness? Unfit people have a\n"
	.string "rough time in emergencies.$"

Route120_Text_JennaDefeat:
	.string "I'm totally fit, but my POKéMON aren't…$"

Route120_Text_JennaPostBattle:
	.string "I run with my POKéMON every day.\p"
	.string "TROPIUS can't run. We still try.$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyIntro:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "Want to battle?$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyDefeat:
	.string "Lost it…$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyPostBattle:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "I'll try harder…$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRegister:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "Do you have a POKéNAV…?$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchIntro:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "Want to battle again?$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchDefeat:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "I lost again…$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyPostRematch:
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\l"
	.string "I'll try harder…\l"
	.string "For my precious BUG POKéMON…$"

Route120_Text_JenniferIntro:
	.string "POKéMON have many abilities. Learn them\n"
	.string "if you want to be first-class.$"

Route120_Text_JenniferDefeat:
	.string "You're clearly thinking.$"

Route120_Text_JenniferPostBattle:
	.string "Abilities change battle styles.\p"
	.string "Especially in this game. Nothing is what\n"
	.string "you remember.$"

Route120_Text_ChipIntro:
	.string "Who might you be?\p"
	.string "Searching for ancient ruins rumored to\n"
	.string "possibly maybe exist according to\l"
	.string "legend?$"

Route120_Text_ChipDefeat:
	.string "A disgraceful setback…$"

Route120_Text_ChipPostBattle:
	.string "That giant rock… I believe it hides\n"
	.string "ancient ruins.\p"
	.string "But there's no entrance.\p"
	.string "I've knocked. Politely.$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaIntro:
	.string "Why do I carry this parasol?\p"
	.string "Beat me and I'll tell you.$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaDefeat:
	.string "A parasol can't block POKéMON attacks…$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaPostBattle:
	.string "Strong sunlight isn't good for my\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "So I shield them.\p"
	.string "It's also a great weapon.$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaIntro:
	.string "Me, my POKéMON, and my parasol…\p"
	.string "Remove any of them and the beauty is\n"
	.string "ruined.$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaDefeat:
	.string "You've ruined my beauty! My mascara is\n"
	.string "running!$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaPostBattle:
	.string "A parasol wouldn't suit you at all.\p"
	.string "You're more of a… hoodie person.$"

Route120_Text_KeigoIntro:
	.string "ORA ORA ORA ORA ORA!$"

Route120_Text_KeigoDefeat:
	.string "YARE YARE DAZE.$"

Route120_Text_KeigoPostBattle:
	.string "It was me, DIO!$"

Route120_Text_RileyIntro:
	.string "Breath of Camouflage, First Form!$"

Route120_Text_RileyDefeat:
	.string "My breathing technique failed…$"

Route120_Text_RileyPostBattle:
	.string "I need a demon slayer sensei. Or a\n"
	.string "snack.$"

Route120_Text_CallieIntro:
	.string "Pay attention or you'll get hurt!$"

Route120_Text_CallieDefeat:
	.string "Ouch! I got hurt.$"

Route120_Text_CalliePostBattle:
	.string "Should I evolve my POKéMON? They're\n"
	.string "cute now.\p"
	.string "My ANNIHILAPE is not cute. It evolved\n"
	.string "out of rage.$"

Route120_Text_LeonelIntro:
	.string "Your team… Do you have different\n"
	.string "types?$"

Route120_Text_LeonelDefeat:
	.string "I've seen your policy in action! It's\n"
	.string "called beating people up.$"

Route120_Text_LeonelPostBattle:
	.string "Strong with your favorite POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Awesome.\p"
	.string "My favorites keep losing. So I switched.$"

Route121_Text_VanessaIntro:
	.string "Will you play with my delightfully\n"
	.string "pretty POKéMON? Pretty please?$"

Route121_Text_VanessaDefeat:
	.string "This isn't what I meant by play!$"

Route121_Text_VanessaPostBattle:
	.string "I'm going to a CONTEST in LILYCOVE.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON will sweep MASTER CLASS.\p"
	.string "After I bribe the judge.$"

Route121_Text_WalterIntro:
	.string "I've traveled the world's four corners\n"
	.string "with my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You might say I'm confident.$"

Route121_Text_WalterDefeat:
	.string "Ah, well played. Fetch my tea, Jeeves.$"

Route121_Text_WalterPostBattle:
	.string "I'd love to circle the globe again with\n"
	.string "my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Six big dogs. Airlines hate me.$"

Route121_Text_WalterRegister:
	.string "Remarkable. Let me register you as a\n"
	.string "memento.$"

Route121_Text_WalterRematchIntro:
	.string "The four corners of the world, and still\n"
	.string "confident.$"

Route121_Text_WalterRematchDefeat:
	.string "Ah, well played. Again. Jeeves, more tea.$"

Route121_Text_WalterPostRematch:
	.string "You and your POKéMON… You'd be strong\n"
	.string "even overseas.\p"
	.string "Pack light. Learn from me.$"

Route121_Text_TammyIntro:
	.string "There are powers beyond our\n"
	.string "understanding…$"

Route121_Text_TammyDefeat:
	.string "I have lost… The spirits warned me. I\n"
	.string "didn't listen.$"

Route121_Text_TammyPostBattle:
	.string "MT. PYRE… A mysterious power is at work\n"
	.string "there…\p"
	.string "Also a gift shop.$"

Route121_Text_KateIntro:
	.string "KATE: Together we're fearless! Watch\n"
	.string "how tough we are!$"

Route121_Text_KateDefeat:
	.string "KATE: I blew it in front of my junior…$"

Route121_Text_KatePostBattle:
	.string "KATE: When someone relies on me, I want\n"
	.string "to look cool.\p"
	.string "I didn't look cool.$"

Route121_Text_KateNotEnoughMons:
	.string "KATE: Only one POKéMON? We can't battle\n"
	.string "you. That would be bullying.$"

Route121_Text_JoyIntro:
	.string "JOY: Together we're fearless! Watch how\n"
	.string "tough we are!$"

Route121_Text_JoyDefeat:
	.string "JOY: Please forgive me, KATE! I'll buy\n"
	.string "you ice cream!$"

Route121_Text_JoyPostBattle:
	.string "JOY: Ehehe, more training with KATE.\p"
	.string "She's very… intense.$"

Route121_Text_JoyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "JOY: Bring at least two POKéMON to\n"
	.string "challenge us!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaIntro:
	.string "Stop! Look at my precious POKéMON!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaDefeat:
	.string "How dare you! Don't take it so\n"
	.string "seriously!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaPostBattle:
	.string "Maybe I'll catch more POKéMON at the\n"
	.string "SAFARI ZONE.\p"
	.string "Prettier ones. That don't lose.$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRegister:
	.string "I went easy on you! Next time I won't!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRematchIntro:
	.string "My precious POKéMON grew! Look!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRematchDefeat:
	.string "How dare you! Still not going easy!$"

Route121_Text_JessicaPostRematch:
	.string "Back to the SAFARI ZONE. For prettier\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route121_Text_CristinIntro:
	.string "My routine: beat five TRAINERS a day.\p"
	.string "Guess what? You're number five!$"

Route121_Text_CristinDefeat:
	.string "No! You're horrid!$"

Route121_Text_CristinPostBattle:
	.string "I didn't expect to lose so easily…\p"
	.string "My routine is ruined. Now I have to\n"
	.string "start over.$"

Route121_Text_CristinRegister:
	.string "Total humiliation! Hand over your\n"
	.string "POKéNAV!$"

Route121_Text_CristinRematchIntro:
	.string "New routine: ten TRAINERS a day.\p"
	.string "You're number ten!$"

Route121_Text_CristinRematchDefeat:
	.string "Wait! That's nasty! Rematch!$"

Route121_Text_CristinPostRematch:
	.string "An opponent I can't beat… Snivel…\p"
	.string "I need a new routine. Maybe yoga.$"

Route121_Text_CaleIntro:
	.string "Can't you see I'm carrying all this\n"
	.string "stuff?\p"
	.string "And you still want to battle?$"

Route121_Text_CaleDefeat:
	.string "Of course I lost! My hands are full!$"

Route121_Text_CalePostBattle:
	.string "I bought too much at the LILYCOVE\n"
	.string "DEPT. STORE.\p"
	.string "I went in for socks.\p"
	.string "I have a lamp, a fern and a canoe now.$"

Route121_Text_MylesIntro:
	.string "Nothing beats checking out other\n"
	.string "people's POKéMON!$"

Route121_Text_MylesDefeat:
	.string "Super awesome! Super loss!$"

Route121_Text_MylesPostBattle:
	.string "Great POKéMON! How do you raise them?\p"
	.string "Mine are all farm animals. It's a\n"
	.string "lifestyle.$"

Route121_Text_PatIntro:
	.string "I want everyone to see the POKéMON I\n"
	.string "raised!$"

Route121_Text_PatDefeat:
	.string "Wow! Spectacular!$"

Route121_Text_PatPostBattle:
	.string "I raise every POKéMON with equal love.\n"
	.string "No favorites.\p"
	.string "…The FURRET is my favorite.$"

Route121_Text_MarcelIntro:
	.string "My POKéMON have never lost!\p"
	.string "One more win and they're going to the\n"
	.string "CONTESTS.$"

Route121_Text_MarcelDefeat:
	.string "Oh, what happened here?$"

Route121_Text_MarcelPostBattle:
	.string "Maybe more training before the\n"
	.string "CONTEST.\p"
	.string "Or more hairspray.$"

Route123_Text_WendyIntro:
	.string "School's out! It's Treasure Hunt\n"
	.string "season!\p"
	.string "My sister VIOLET is somewhere on this\n"
	.string "route. We're competing.$"

Route123_Text_WendyDefeat:
	.string "…Picnic break?$"

Route123_Text_WendyPostBattle:
	.string "My sandwich had no shiny power.\p"
	.string "VIOLET says: add more HERBA MYSTICA.\p"
	.string "She's always right. Ugh.$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonIntro:
	.string "That's a big BADGE collection.\p"
	.string "Let's see if you deserve them!$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonDefeat:
	.string "Oh, you deserve them, all right!$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonPostBattle:
	.string "You did your BADGES proud!\p"
	.string "I have zero BADGES. But I have opinions.$"

Route123_Text_VioletIntro:
	.string "They say good times are filled with good\n"
	.string "aromas.\p"
	.string "And good mushrooms.\p"
	.string "Whoa… your face is melting. Beautiful.\n"
	.string "Let's battle.$"

Route123_Text_VioletDefeat:
	.string "Oh… I can taste the colors of defeat…$"

Route123_Text_VioletPostBattle:
	.string "The BERRY MASTER's garden is so\n"
	.string "uplifting.\p"
	.string "Last time I talked to a tree for six\n"
	.string "hours.\p"
	.string "It had great advice.$"

Route123_Text_CameronIntro:
	.string "Being a psychic is about willpower. I've\n"
	.string "manifested my victory.$"

Route123_Text_CameronDefeat:
	.string "My vision board lied…$"

Route123_Text_CameronPostBattle:
	.string "I manifested winning. The universe left\n"
	.string "me on read.$"

Route123_Text_CameronRegister:
	.string "I sense it! We'll battle again!\p"
	.string "I've already visualized it. On my vision\n"
	.string "board.$"

Route123_Text_CameronRematchIntro:
	.string "I won't lose anymore. It's called the law\n"
	.string "of attraction.$"

Route123_Text_CameronRematchDefeat:
	.string "The universe is ghosting me.$"

Route123_Text_CameronPostRematch:
	.string "I'll train at MT. PYRE.\p"
	.string "And make a bigger vision board.$"

Route123_Text_JackiIntro:
	.string "Don't be happy if your POKéMON develop\n"
	.string "psychic powers. Mine read my diary.$"

Route123_Text_JackiDefeat:
	.string "My aura is beige now.$"

Route123_Text_JackiPostBattle:
	.string "We all have psychic powers.\p"
	.string "Mine is knowing when POKéMON read my\n"
	.string "diary.$"

Route123_Text_JackiRegister:
	.string "I'd like to face you again.\p"
	.string "My crystals say yes.$"

Route123_Text_JackiRematchIntro:
	.string "Have you awoken your psychic powers?\n"
	.string "No? Have you tried crystals?$"

Route123_Text_JackiRematchDefeat:
	.string "Bad karma for me, good dharma for you.$"

Route123_Text_JackiPostRematch:
	.string "Your power with POKéMON…\p"
	.string "Maybe you're psychic too. Or just good.\n"
	.string "Ugh.$"

Route123_Text_MiuIntro:
	.string "MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your POKéMON\n"
	.string "won't cry when they lose.$"

Route123_Text_MiuDefeat:
	.string "MIU: Uh-oh, we lost. YUKI's fault.$"

Route123_Text_MiuPostBattle:
	.string "MIU: Your POKéMON are strong because\n"
	.string "you're friends.\p"
	.string "Ours are strong because we yell.$"

Route123_Text_MiuNotEnoughMons:
	.string "MIU: No fun without two POKéMON.$"

Route123_Text_YukiIntro:
	.string "YUKI: Okay! We're beating the TRAINER's\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

Route123_Text_YukiDefeat:
	.string "YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost. MIU's fault.$"

Route123_Text_YukiPostBattle:
	.string "YUKI: Why are you so strong? We've\n"
	.string "never lost.\p"
	.string "We've also never battled. Until now.$"

Route123_Text_YukiNotEnoughMons:
	.string "YUKI: No fun without two POKéMON.$"

Route123_Text_KindraIntro:
	.string "MT. PYRE… Where the spirits of POKéMON\n"
	.string "sleep…\p"
	.string "Will your POKéMON sleep too?$"

Route123_Text_KindraDefeat:
	.string "Overflowing with vitality… Disgusting.$"

Route123_Text_KindraPostBattle:
	.string "MT. PYRE… Where POKéMON spirits sleep…\p"
	.string "It must be full of soothing power…\p"
	.string "Or just very quiet.$"

Route123_Text_FernandoIntro:
	.string "If you like to gamble, I tell you I'm your\n"
	.string "man\l"
	.string "You win some, lose some, it's all the\l"
	.string "same to me\p"
	.string "The pleasure is to play, it makes no\n"
	.string "difference what you say\l"
	.string "I don't share your greed, the only card\l"
	.string "I need is\p"
	.string "THE ACE OF SPADES!$"

Route123_Text_FernandoDefeat:
	.string "THE ACE OF SPADES!$"

Route123_Text_FernandoPostBattle:
	.string "Fuck, man.\p"
	.string "LEMMY, why did you have to go?$"

Route123_Text_FernandoRegister:
	.string "Next time, listen to the whole song.\p"
	.string "It's Motörhead. It's two minutes. You\n"
	.string "can do it.$"

Route123_Text_FernandoRematchIntro:
	.string "Take one to the mountain\n"
	.string "Take one to the sea\p"
	.string "Take one to the belly of the beast\n"
	.string "And then you'll take one with me$"

Route123_Text_FernandoRematchDefeat:
	.string "Shut it.$"

Route123_Text_FernandoPostRematch:
	.string "Take one with me…\p"
	.string "…No? Fine. Shut it.$"

Route123_Text_DavisIntro:
	.string "LET'S GO! KNEECAPS!\p"
	.string "I gotta catch more POKéMON!\p"
	.string "POKéMON with cool knees are so neat.$"

Route123_Text_DavisDefeat:
	.string "My knees… they buckled…$"

Route123_Text_DavisPostBattle:
	.string "BUG POKéMON have six knees each.\p"
	.string "Six!\p"
	.string "Do the math. That's so many knees.$"

Route123_Text_JazmynIntro:
	.string "Our teacher said: find your own\n"
	.string "treasure.\p"
	.string "SCARLET went the other way. Typical.$"

Route123_Text_JazmynDefeat:
	.string "I need a sandwich. A big one.$"

Route123_Text_JazmynPostBattle:
	.string "I told SCARLET a hundred times.\p"
	.string "More HERBA MYSTICA.$"

Route123_Text_FrederickIntro:
	.string "Hello, child! Can you spare some time?\p"
	.string "I'm a grown man approaching children on\n"
	.string "a road. Totally normal.$"

Route123_Text_FrederickDefeat:
	.string "A capable child! Let me add to your\n"
	.string "allowance.$"

Route123_Text_FrederickPostBattle:
	.string "Add to your allowance?\p"
	.string "Wasn't the prize money enough?\p"
	.string "Kids today.$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoIntro:
	.string "BIRD POKéMON are my obsession!\p"
	.string "Birds are cool! The best!$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoDefeat:
	.string "Even in defeat, BIRD POKéMON are cool!\n"
	.string "Birds are real!$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoPostBattle:
	.string "I collect feathers from battles.\p"
	.string "I'm making a hat.\p"
	.string "The TOGEKISS is not happy about it.$"

Route123_Text_EdIntro:
	.string "When no TRAINERS are around, I make my\n"
	.string "POKéMON fight each other.\p"
	.string "And I watch.$"

Route123_Text_EdDefeat:
	.string "I kind of like your POKéMON. Can I sniff\n"
	.string "it?$"

Route123_Text_EdPostBattle:
	.string "Hehe, I'm stealing your battle ideas!\p"
	.string "And I'll make my POKéMON try them on\n"
	.string "each other.$"

Route123_Text_JonasIntro:
	.string "I lay in ambush! I'll write your name in\n"
	.string "my notebook!$"

Route123_Text_JonasDefeat:
	.string "I'll take a potato chip… AND EAT IT!$"

Route123_Text_JonasPostBattle:
	.string "L is watching me. Probably.$"

Route123_Text_KayleyIntro:
	.string "I just bought this parasol!\p"
	.string "My cuteness is up by a third!$"

Route123_Text_KayleyDefeat:
	.string "You're better than me by about five\n"
	.string "times!$"

Route123_Text_KayleyPostBattle:
	.string "Accessories are the secret of fashion.\p"
	.string "Also of losing. Apparently.$"

Route124_Text_SpencerIntro:
	.string "Lost at sea?\p"
	.string "Beat my POKéMON and I'll be your pilot.$"

Route124_Text_SpencerDefeat:
	.string "I lost my bearings!$"

Route124_Text_SpencerPostBattle:
	.string "Lots of people get lost at sea.\p"
	.string "Check the POKéNAV MAP.\p"
	.string "Or follow the Wailord. They know.$"

Route124_Text_RolandIntro:
	.string "You're riding a POKéMON? I want to surf\n"
	.string "on a WAILORD. The biggest one.\p"
	.string "Nobody lets me. Something about “sir,\n"
	.string "that's a whale.”$"

Route124_Text_RolandDefeat:
	.string "Oh! I can't…$"

Route124_Text_RolandPostBattle:
	.string "I'm getting chilled.\p"
	.string "Still no WAILORD. “Sir, that's a whale,”\n"
	.string "they say.$"

Route124_Text_JennyIntro:
	.string "Float in the sea like this, and POKéMON\n"
	.string "come to play.$"

Route124_Text_JennyDefeat:
	.string "Oh, darn. I lost.$"

Route124_Text_JennyPostBattle:
	.string "Some POKéMON attack. Some just watch.\p"
	.string "The ones who watch are the creepy ones.$"

Route124_Text_JennyRegister:
	.string "On a whim… register me?$"

Route124_Text_JennyRematchIntro:
	.string "Float in the sea, and TRAINERS\n"
	.string "challenge you!$"

Route124_Text_JennyRematchDefeat:
	.string "Strange… I lost again…$"

Route124_Text_JennyPostRematch:
	.string "Unrelated, but I've been floating for\n"
	.string "eleven hours.\p"
	.string "I can't feel my toes.$"

Route124_Text_GraceIntro:
	.string "I'm bored of swimming… Battle?$"

Route124_Text_GraceDefeat:
	.string "I had no idea you were this strong!$"

Route124_Text_GracePostBattle:
	.string "All your effort made you strong.\p"
	.string "I made zero effort. It shows.$"

Route124_Text_ChadIntro:
	.string "Fufufufu… I dive deep to go\n"
	.string "undercover.\p"
	.string "Plumbing the depths is my thing!$"

Route124_Text_ChadDefeat:
	.string "Glub, glub… I'm sinking…$"

Route124_Text_ChadPostBattle:
	.string "There's a DIVE spot near here.\p"
	.string "I feel the urge to go deep again.\p"
	.string "Don't make it weird.$"

Route124_Text_LilaIntro:
	.string "LILA: Sigh…\p"
	.string "Here I am at sea, and who's with me? My\n"
	.string "little brother!\p"
	.string "Battle me so I stop thinking about it!$"

Route124_Text_LilaDefeat:
	.string "LILA: ROY! It's your fault! You're in for\n"
	.string "it later!$"

Route124_Text_LilaPostBattle:
	.string "LILA: Sigh…\p"
	.string "If only it was a nice boyfriend here\n"
	.string "instead of my brother…$"

Route124_Text_LilaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "LILA: Battle us? Not without two\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route124_Text_RoyIntro:
	.string "ROY: My big sister is super tough at\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Don't cry when you lose! Okay, you can\n"
	.string "cry a little.$"

Route124_Text_RoyDefeat:
	.string "ROY: Uh-oh… She's gonna chew me out…$"

Route124_Text_RoyPostBattle:
	.string "ROY: My sister is scary when she's\n"
	.string "angry.\p"
	.string "That's why she doesn't have a\n"
	.string "boyfriend.$"

Route124_Text_LilaRoyRegister:
	.string "ROY: Battle us again sometime? But go\n"
	.string "easy on us next time, okay?$"

Route124_Text_RoyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "ROY: Want to battle us? Bring two\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchIntro:
	.string "LILA: Sigh… Still at sea. Still with my\n"
	.string "brother.\p"
	.string "Oh, hi. Battle me so I stop thinking\n"
	.string "about it!$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchDefeat:
	.string "LILA: ROY! Your fault AGAIN! Training\n"
	.string "session later!$"

Route124_Text_LilaPostRematch:
	.string "LILA: Sigh…\p"
	.string "With a nice boyfriend we'd beat anyone.\p"
	.string "I'm on three dating apps. At sea.$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "LILA: Battle us? Not without two\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchIntro:
	.string "ROY: If we lose, I'm in trouble. All out!$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchDefeat:
	.string "ROY: Uh-oh… Chewed out again.$"

Route124_Text_RoyPostRematch:
	.string "ROY: She's making me train with POKéMON\n"
	.string "later.\p"
	.string "I'd rather drown.$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "ROY: Want to battle us? Bring two\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route124_Text_DeclanIntro:
	.string "Swimming alone on this wide, beautiful\n"
	.string "sea.\p"
	.string "There's no other word for it. Pathetic!$"

Route124_Text_DeclanDefeat:
	.string "I'm blue. Blue as the sky…$"

Route124_Text_DeclanPostBattle:
	.string "I should chat up lady SWIMMERS and\n"
	.string "invite them for a long swim.\p"
	.string "They swim away. Fast.$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaIntro:
	.string "I'm not losing to some surfer.$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaDefeat:
	.string "It's sweat in my eyes! I'm NOT crying!$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaPostBattle:
	.string "There are pretty colored shards around\n"
	.string "here.\p"
	.string "The DIVING TREASURE HUNTER wants\n"
	.string "them. Weirdo.$"

Route125_Text_NolenIntro:
	.string "I heard you coming, so I waited!$"

Route125_Text_NolenDefeat:
	.string "I surrender! Throw me a lifebuoy!$"

Route125_Text_NolenPostBattle:
	.string "Sound travels faster in water than in\n"
	.string "air.\p"
	.string "That's why I heard you. You're loud.$"

Route125_Text_StanIntro:
	.string "Hey there! Check out my sweet POKéMON!$"

Route125_Text_StanDefeat:
	.string "I floundered. Like a FLOUNDER. Is that a\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

Route125_Text_StanPostBattle:
	.string "I was blown away by HORSEA's charm, so I\n"
	.string "started swimming.\p"
	.string "That's how it starts. Then you're in the\n"
	.string "sea every day.$"

Route125_Text_TanyaIntro:
	.string "I'm tired of swimming. Battle?$"

Route125_Text_TanyaDefeat:
	.string "You're too much! Way too much!$"

Route125_Text_TanyaPostBattle:
	.string "Whew… Which way is MOSSDEEP?\p"
	.string "I've been swimming in circles since\n"
	.string "Tuesday.$"

Route125_Text_SharonIntro:
	.string "Want to take on the WATER POKéMON I\n"
	.string "raised?$"

Route125_Text_SharonDefeat:
	.string "Lost it… My bikini top too. Don't look!$"

Route125_Text_SharonPostBattle:
	.string "Your power… You're the real deal.$"

Route125_Text_ErnestIntro:
	.string "Ahoy! I'm a buff, tough SAILOR! I've\n"
	.string "braved every sea!$"

Route125_Text_ErnestDefeat:
	.string "Gwrroooar! I couldn't win!$"

Route125_Text_ErnestPostBattle:
	.string "The tide rises and falls inside SHOAL\n"
	.string "CAVE.\p"
	.string "About six hours from high to low tide.\p"
	.string "Write it down. Seriously.$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRegister:
	.string "Register me, and I'll tell you something\n"
	.string "good.$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchIntro:
	.string "Payback time! We're battling!$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchDefeat:
	.string "I couldn't win! Flat out couldn't!$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchPostBattle:
	.string "SHOAL CAVE… Some spots depend on the\n"
	.string "tide.\p"
	.string "Six hours high to low. Don't forget!\p"
	.string "That's the something good. That's it.$"

Route125_Text_KimIntro:
	.string "KIM: A funny old man lives in SHOAL CAVE.\p"
	.string "Are you going to see him too?$"

Route125_Text_KimDefeat:
	.string "KIM: I thought we'd win.$"

Route125_Text_KimPostBattle:
	.string "KIM: A funny old man lives in SHOAL CAVE.\p"
	.string "Let's go see him, IRIS!$"

Route125_Text_KimNotEnoughMons:
	.string "KIM: No, no, no! You need two POKéMON!$"

Route125_Text_IrisIntro:
	.string "IRIS: KIM, what are we looking for out\n"
	.string "here?$"

Route125_Text_IrisDefeat:
	.string "IRIS: We were sort of close.$"

Route125_Text_IrisPostBattle:
	.string "IRIS: KIM, we're going into a cave to\n"
	.string "visit an old man?\p"
	.string "That's how horror movies start.$"

Route125_Text_IrisNotEnoughMons:
	.string "IRIS: We could never do a 2-on-1 battle.$"

Route125_Text_PresleyIntro:
	.string "Why would a BIRD KEEPER be out at sea?$"

Route125_Text_PresleyDefeat:
	.string "Okay. I'll tell you why I'm here.$"

Route125_Text_PresleyPostBattle:
	.string "I put a message in a bottle.\p"
	.string "A girl SWIMMER will find it!\p"
	.string "It has my number. And a drawing of a\n"
	.string "bird.$"

Route125_Text_AuronIntro:
	.string "Hey! Did you throw garbage in the sea?$"

Route125_Text_AuronDefeat:
	.string "Oh, you didn't throw trash in the sea.$"

Route125_Text_AuronPostBattle:
	.string "I found a filthy bottle bobbing in the\n"
	.string "waves.\p"
	.string "Someone put a note in it! With a bird\n"
	.string "drawing! Disgusting!$"

Route126_Text_BarryIntro:
	.string "Swimming is a full-body workout! You'll\n"
	.string "get fit!$"

Route126_Text_BarryDefeat:
	.string "I admit it! You win!$"

Route126_Text_BarryPostBattle:
	.string "Thanks to daily swimming… Look! Feast\n"
	.string "your eyes on this physique!\p"
	.string "…Why are you looking away?$"

Route126_Text_DeanIntro:
	.string "That towering white rock is SOOTOPOLIS\n"
	.string "CITY.$"

Route126_Text_DeanDefeat:
	.string "Done in?$"

Route126_Text_DeanPostBattle:
	.string "I can't find the entrance to\n"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS.\p"
	.string "Three years. Still looking.$"

Route126_Text_NikkiIntro:
	.string "Ufufufufu! I'm a mermaid!$"

Route126_Text_NikkiDefeat:
	.string "My fantasy popped like a bubble! Blub,\n"
	.string "blub…$"

Route126_Text_NikkiPostBattle:
	.string "You thrashed me…\p"
	.string "I want to vanish in a wave of despair…\p"
	.string "Mermaids are dramatic.$"

Route126_Text_BrendaIntro:
	.string "Hello, kiddo! Want a battle?$"

Route126_Text_BrendaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, noooooh! I swallowed seawater!$"

Route126_Text_BrendaPostBattle:
	.string "I love frolicking with POKéMON in the\n"
	.string "sea!\p"
	.string "The OCTILLERY frolics back. With ink.$"

Route126_Text_PabloIntro:
	.string "Check out this sculpted body!\p"
	.string "More cut than a BLACK BELT!$"

Route126_Text_PabloDefeat:
	.string "Whoops! Too strong! Not bad at all!$"

Route126_Text_PabloPostBattle:
	.string "Losing stimulates my senses!\p"
	.string "I'll train harder! Protein shake time!$"

Route126_Text_PabloRegister:
	.string "Not bad at all! I want to get to know\n"
	.string "you!\p"
	.string "And your workout routine.$"

Route126_Text_PabloRematchIntro:
	.string "Check out this beautiful body!\p"
	.string "More shapely than a SWIMMER!$"

Route126_Text_PabloRematchDefeat:
	.string "Whoops! Really too strong!$"

Route126_Text_PabloPostRematch:
	.string "You're a great motivator!\p"
	.string "Come back! I'll be here. Flexing.$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoIntro:
	.string "Last year I couldn't swim. Now I'm\n"
	.string "decent!\p"
	.string "I can do anything now!$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoDefeat:
	.string "Getting greedy didn't help.$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoPostBattle:
	.string "Practice makes you better.\p"
	.string "You're young. Try all sorts of things!\p"
	.string "Except swimming here. SHARPEDO.$"

Route126_Text_IsobelIntro:
	.string "Doesn't seawater up your nose feel\n"
	.string "terrible?$"

Route126_Text_IsobelDefeat:
	.string "Ack! Why, you… Glub!$"

Route126_Text_IsobelPostBattle:
	.string "I choked on seawater! Bitter! Salty!\p"
	.string "That's the whole sea in one mouthful.$"

Route126_Text_SiennaIntro:
	.string "I'm throwing my whole heart into this!$"

Route126_Text_SiennaDefeat:
	.string "You had more heart! And more POKéMON!$"

Route126_Text_SiennaPostBattle:
	.string "I need to cool down… I'll go for a dive.\p"
	.string "Or cry underwater. Nobody can tell.$"

Route127_Text_CamdenIntro:
	.string "I can see it in your face. You want to\n"
	.string "challenge me.$"

Route127_Text_CamdenDefeat:
	.string "Awawawawawa… Blub.$"

Route127_Text_CamdenPostBattle:
	.string "A well-played match leaves me\n"
	.string "refreshed and serene.\p"
	.string "This one left me wet.$"

Route127_Text_DonnyIntro:
	.string "Do you have a rival you hate losing to?$"

Route127_Text_DonnyDefeat:
	.string "Arrrgh! I hate losing!$"

Route127_Text_DonnyPostBattle:
	.string "With a rival, you have to keep improving.\p"
	.string "Mine is my brother. He's a dentist. I'm\n"
	.string "this.$"

Route127_Text_JonahIntro:
	.string "Through fishing, I've reached a state\n"
	.string "of calm serenity…\p"
	.string "Allow me to demonstrate…$"

Route127_Text_JonahDefeat:
	.string "Though I lost, my heart remains calm…$"

Route127_Text_JonahPostBattle:
	.string "It doesn't matter that I catch nothing.\p"
	.string "The line stays in the water…\p"
	.string "I haven't caught a fish since 2009.$"

Route127_Text_HenryIntro:
	.string "Whoops! Did I just hook a SURFING\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

Route127_Text_HenryDefeat:
	.string "I can't keep up! My reel is spinning!$"

Route127_Text_HenryPostBattle:
	.string "Hooking your POKéMON would be a\n"
	.string "handful!\p"
	.string "Also probably illegal.$"

Route127_Text_RogerIntro:
	.string "A POKéMON fan versus a fishing buff!$"

Route127_Text_RogerDefeat:
	.string "My line's tangled! Party's over!$"

Route127_Text_RogerPostBattle:
	.string "My fishing line is dancing! The tangle\n"
	.string "tango!\p"
	.string "Hahaha! …Help me untangle it?$"

Route127_Text_AidanIntro:
	.string "BIRD POKéMON have great eyesight.\p"
	.string "They spot prey from far above.$"

Route127_Text_AidanDefeat:
	.string "Whew… I give up. Wake me when it's over.$"

Route127_Text_AidanPostBattle:
	.string "There are lots of DIVE spots around\n"
	.string "here.\p"
	.string "They're darker. Easy to spot from the\n"
	.string "sky.\p"
	.string "My birds see them. They don't tell me.$"

Route127_Text_KojiIntro:
	.string "Run barefoot. It toughens your soles!$"

Route127_Text_KojiDefeat:
	.string "Yowch! A pebble under my toenail!$"

Route127_Text_KojiPostBattle:
	.string "Barefoot feels great.\p"
	.string "But your RUNNING SHOES are cool too.\p"
	.string "What size are you?$"

Route127_Text_KojiRegister:
	.string "This is what I do to people who beat me!\p"
	.string "I register them. Let's go again\n"
	.string "sometime.$"

Route127_Text_KojiRematchIntro:
	.string "I still run barefoot daily. My soles are\n"
	.string "leather now!$"

Route127_Text_KojiRematchDefeat:
	.string "Yowch! Pebbles in my arches!$"

Route127_Text_KojiPostRematch:
	.string "Want to go barefoot for a while?\p"
	.string "So I can try your RUNNING SHOES?\p"
	.string "I'll give them back. Probably.$"

Route127_Text_AthenaIntro:
	.string "Let's have a slow, methodical match.$"

Route127_Text_AthenaDefeat:
	.string "You didn't give me any time to\n"
	.string "strategize.$"

Route127_Text_AthenaPostBattle:
	.string "Surrounded by blue sea and sky, time\n"
	.string "slows down.\p"
	.string "My battles too, apparently.$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahIntro:
	.string "EVER GRANDE CITY is still so far away…$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahDefeat:
	.string "My first win seems far away too…$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahPostBattle:
	.string "My whole life has been losing.\p"
	.string "But I'll never give up!\p"
	.string "That's either admirable or a problem.$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRegister:
	.string "I'm not good now, but I'll win\n"
	.string "eventually.\p"
	.string "Register me. Witness history. Slowly.$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchIntro:
	.string "Still feeling good! Still swimming to\n"
	.string "EVER GRANDE!$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchDefeat:
	.string "Still no first victory…$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahPostRematch:
	.string "I'll reach EVER GRANDE eventually.\p"
	.string "And win. Eventually.\p"
	.string "Eventually is a big word.$"

Route128_Text_KatelynIntro:
	.string "Triathlon: swim, cycle, then run a\n"
	.string "marathon.\p"
	.string "Three events. All grueling.$"

Route128_Text_KatelynDefeat:
	.string "POKéMON battles are grueling too…$"

Route128_Text_KatelynPostBattle:
	.string "I have to cycle next, but…\p"
	.string "I'm about to throw in the towel. And my\n"
	.string "bike.$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRegister:
	.string "Might as well make the best of it.\n"
	.string "Rematch sometime.$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRematchIntro:
	.string "A triathlon is long.\p"
	.string "The road to CHAMPION is long too.\p"
	.string "Both hurt your feet.$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRematchDefeat:
	.string "POKéMON battles are harsh…$"

Route128_Text_KatelynPostRematch:
	.string "Think carefully about VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "It's full of jerkoffs.$"

Route128_Text_AlexaIntro:
	.string "We've worked so hard for the LEAGUE…\p"
	.string "We can't lose now!$"

Route128_Text_AlexaDefeat:
	.string "Oh! How could this happen?!$"

Route128_Text_AlexaPostBattle:
	.string "After everything, I won't quit over one\n"
	.string "setback.\p"
	.string "Maybe two. Two and I quit.$"

Route128_Text_RubenIntro:
	.string "There is no stronger TRAINER than me!$"

Route128_Text_RubenDefeat:
	.string "This can't be! I've trained for 20 years!$"

Route128_Text_RubenPostBattle:
	.string "There's probably no stronger TRAINER\n"
	.string "than you!\p"
	.string "I'll just say that about you now. Saves\n"
	.string "time.$"

Route128_Text_WayneIntro:
	.string "I want to visit EVER GRANDE, so I\n"
	.string "caught a POKéMON with WATERFALL.$"

Route128_Text_WayneDefeat:
	.string "I'm crestfallen! Like a GYARADOS\n"
	.string "without a crest!$"

Route128_Text_WaynePostBattle:
	.string "Awww, phooey!\p"
	.string "My POKéMON knows WATERFALL, but I\n"
	.string "don't have WALLACE's BADGE!\p"
	.string "He wants me to bring wine first.$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonIntro:
	.string "You look awfully tough. Can I win?$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonDefeat:
	.string "Ouch! Guess not.$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonPostBattle:
	.string "Tough TRAINERS everywhere near EVER\n"
	.string "GRANDE.\p"
	.string "Am I out of my league? Don't answer.$"

Route128_Text_CarleeIntro:
	.string "The sunlight is harsher here.$"

Route128_Text_CarleeDefeat:
	.string "I couldn't see because of the glare.$"

Route128_Text_CarleePostBattle:
	.string "I need to reapply sunscreen.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON are ICE types. They're\n"
	.string "sweating.$"

Route129_Text_ChaseIntro:
	.string "My first triathlon! I'm so nervous!$"

Route129_Text_ChaseDefeat:
	.string "Wroooaaar! I didn't win!$"

Route129_Text_ChasePostBattle:
	.string "If I'm tense, I can't give it my all.\p"
	.string "I'm always tense. So, you know.$"

Route129_Text_AllisonIntro:
	.string "I'm mid-triathlon, but sure, let's\n"
	.string "battle.$"

Route129_Text_AllisonDefeat:
	.string "I was so sure I'd win! Why am I always so\n"
	.string "sure?!$"

Route129_Text_AllisonPostBattle:
	.string "The best part of a triathlon?\p"
	.string "Testing your limits against Mother\n"
	.string "Nature!\p"
	.string "Mother Nature is winning.$"

Route129_Text_ReedIntro:
	.string "Please, you shall bear witness to our\n"
	.string "artistry. A grand illusion of water\l"
	.string "sculpted by Pokémon and myself!$"

Route129_Text_ReedDefeat:
	.string "Ahahaha, excellent!\n"
	.string "Very well, you are the winner.$"

Route129_Text_ReedPostBattle:
	.string "From you, I sense the brilliant shine\n"
	.string "of skill that will overcome all!\p"
	.string "However, you are somewhat lacking\n"
	.string "in elegance.\p"
	.string "Perhaps I should make you a loan\n"
	.string "of my outfit? ... Hahaha!\l"
	.string "I merely jest!$"
	
Route129_Text_TishaIntro:
	.string "What's the hurry? Let's take it slow.$"

Route129_Text_TishaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, my. I wanted to relax a bit more…$"

Route129_Text_TishaPostBattle:
	.string "Mistakes happen when you rush.\p"
	.string "So I take things slowly.\p"
	.string "This sentence took me three minutes.$"

Route129_Text_ClarenceIntro:
	.string "Surfing isn't as easy as it looks, right?$"

Route129_Text_ClarenceDefeat:
	.string "Winning isn't easy either.$"

Route129_Text_ClarencePostBattle:
	.string "Aiming for the LEAGUE? Keep at it!$"

Route130_Text_RodneyIntro:
	.string "A TRAINER out at sea? Let's battle!$"

Route130_Text_RodneyDefeat:
	.string "This kid is tough…$"

Route130_Text_RodneyPostBattle:
	.string "Your eyes look like you've survived\n"
	.string "harsh challenges.\p"
	.string "Or no sleep. Suits you, though.$"

Route130_Text_KatieIntro:
	.string "In the deep blue sea, my shattered blue\n"
	.string "heart finds comfort among the waves.$"

Route130_Text_KatieDefeat:
	.string "Like the vast sea, the world of POKéMON\n"
	.string "is deeper than I thought.$"

Route130_Text_KatiePostBattle:
	.string "Every child dreams of becoming\n"
	.string "CHAMPION.\p"
	.string "I dreamed of becoming a mermaid. Nikki\n"
	.string "beat me to it.$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoIntro:
	.string "Floating on the open sea… Why am I\n"
	.string "always just floating here?\p"
	.string "I never move. I've been in this exact\n"
	.string "spot since the day this game came out.$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoDefeat:
	.string "And now I'll just… stay here.\n"
	.string "Motionless. Again.$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoPostBattle:
	.string "Swimming and battling…\p"
	.string "No. Just floating. As always.$"

Route131_Text_RichardIntro:
	.string "The sea is full of POKéMON. Swimming\n"
	.string "here is hard.$"

Route131_Text_RichardDefeat:
	.string "TRAINER POKéMON are seriously tough…$"

Route131_Text_RichardPostBattle:
	.string "Gasp… Gasp… I'm wiped out…\p"
	.string "Getting here was easy. Getting back is\n"
	.string "the hard part.\p"
	.string "I might just live here now.$"

Route131_Text_HermanIntro:
	.string "The sea… The sea… The sea!\p"
	.string "As far as I can see! I'm sick of the sea!$"

Route131_Text_HermanDefeat:
	.string "Bleah! I swallowed a TENTACOOL!$"

Route131_Text_HermanPostBattle:
	.string "I'm bored of the sea, but I must swim.\p"
	.string "I'm a born swimmer. It's a curse.$"

Route131_Text_SusieIntro:
	.string "Hi, sweetie, wait! We should battle!$"

Route131_Text_SusieDefeat:
	.string "Tough, in spite of how you look!$"

Route131_Text_SusiePostBattle:
	.string "See the guy who whines about being\n"
	.string "bored of the sea?\p"
	.string "All talk. He's hopelessly in love with it.\p"
	.string "He proposed to a wave once.$"

Route131_Text_KaraIntro:
	.string "Why do men love bathing suits so much?\p"
	.string "They all ogle me!\p"
	.string "…Oh. You're wondering where my POKé\n"
	.string "BALLS are.$"

Route131_Text_KaraDefeat:
	.string "Teehee…\p"
	.string "You still don't know.$"

Route131_Text_KaraPostBattle:
	.string "If I'm wearing a bikini… where do I put\n"
	.string "my POKé BALLS?\p"
	.string "Teehee… Woman's secret!$"

Route131_Text_ReliIntro:
	.string "RELI: We siblings will take you on\n"
	.string "together!$"

Route131_Text_ReliDefeat:
	.string "RELI: We worked together and still\n"
	.string "lost…$"

Route131_Text_ReliPostBattle:
	.string "RELI: PACIFIDLOG people live with the\n"
	.string "sea from birth.\p"
	.string "We have no choice. There's nothing else\n"
	.string "there.$"

Route131_Text_ReliNotEnoughMons:
	.string "RELI: No two POKéMON? Then no battle.$"

Route131_Text_IanIntro:
	.string "IAN: I'm doing my best with my sis!$"

Route131_Text_IanDefeat:
	.string "IAN: I did my best and we still lost…$"

Route131_Text_IanPostBattle:
	.string "IAN: PACIFIDLOG is a floating town.\p"
	.string "So wherever there's sea, that's\n"
	.string "PACIFIDLOG!\p"
	.string "Still no supermarket, though.$"

Route131_Text_IanNotEnoughMons:
	.string "IAN: Bring two POKéMON and we'll take\n"
	.string "you on!$"

Route131_Text_TaliaIntro:
	.string "Beat me and I'll give you great\n"
	.string "information!$"

Route131_Text_TaliaDefeat:
	.string "Oh? Did I lose?$"

Route131_Text_TaliaPostBattle:
	.string "There's an odd place nearby with a huge\n"
	.string "tower.\p"
	.string "Go look.\p"
	.string "That's the great information. Sorry.$"

Route131_Text_KevinIntro:
	.string "PACIFIDLOG people are peaceful. They\n"
	.string "never get angry.\p"
	.string "Me neither.$"

Route131_Text_KevinDefeat:
	.string "Oops! That was supposed to go the\n"
	.string "other way!$"

Route131_Text_KevinPostBattle:
	.string "Tch! …Oh, wait. I'm not angry. Honestly!\p"
	.string "I'm SO calm. SO CALM.$"

Route132_Text_GilbertIntro:
	.string "I was always sick as a kid.\p"
	.string "Then I started swimming, and now I'm\n"
	.string "fit!$"

Route132_Text_GilbertDefeat:
	.string "I crave more power… And a sandwich.$"

Route132_Text_GilbertPostBattle:
	.string "TRAINERS walk all day, so they must be\n"
	.string "fit too.\p"
	.string "Or they ride bikes. Cheaters.$"

Route132_Text_DanaIntro:
	.string "I avoid swimming where the currents are\n"
	.string "strong.$"

Route132_Text_DanaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, please, no! Not in front of the\n"
	.string "WAILMER!$"

Route132_Text_DanaPostBattle:
	.string "If I get swept away, I lose all sense of\n"
	.string "direction.\p"
	.string "Last time I ended up in PACIFIDLOG.\n"
	.string "Horrible.$"

Route132_Text_RonaldIntro:
	.string "People say SNEASLER is the INCINEROAR\n"
	.string "counter. Amateurs.\p"
	.string "MILOTIC. That cat uses Intimidate,\n"
	.string "Competitive kicks in, and then it's\l"
	.string "WATER straight in his face.\p"
	.string "…Wait. In this game MILOTIC only gets\n"
	.string "scale abilities? Marvel Scale,\l"
	.string "Multiscale… Who made this game?!$"

Route132_Text_RonaldDefeat:
	.string "I don't care that I lost. At least I'll\n"
	.string "never lose to INCINEROAR!$"

Route132_Text_RonaldPostBattle:
	.string "I only battle at the edge of victory.\p"
	.string "Or against INCINEROAR. Same thing.$"

Route132_Text_KiyoIntro:
	.string "I've been practicing Muay Thai a lot for\n"
	.string "the past 6 months, I've been kicking\l"
	.string "trees daily, my shins are made of iron\l"
	.string "now. My trainer says I'm Bangkok ready!$"

Route132_Text_KiyoDefeat:
	.string "Wait, women there aren't always female?$"

Route132_Text_KiyoPostBattle:
	.string "That sounds like a nightmare, I guess I\n"
	.string "am not Bangkok ready at all, time to\l"
	.string "memorize how I can distinguish females\l"
	.string "from males$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaIntro:
	.string "Woo-hoo! My husband got food\n"
	.string "poisoning, so now I get to do whatever I\l"
	.string "want to do!$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, I wasn't good enough.\p"
	.string "Still better than a day with my husband.$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaPostBattle:
	.string "That young man over there looks like my\n"
	.string "husband when he was young.\p"
	.string "He's making me blush!\p"
	.string "My husband is in the hospital. Whatever.$"

Route132_Text_JonathanIntro:
	.string "Someone's been staring at me. Was it\n"
	.string "you?$"

Route132_Text_JonathanDefeat:
	.string "Wow! Pretty strong!$"

Route132_Text_JonathanPostBattle:
	.string "I still feel someone watching me.\p"
	.string "I can't concentrate!\p"
	.string "That old lady keeps winking at me.$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonIntro:
	.string "Where could my wife be? I'm always with\n"
	.string "her.\p"
	.string "I had a bad stomach. I went to the\n"
	.string "toilet. She was gone.$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonDefeat:
	.string "I couldn't win on my own after all.$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonPostBattle:
	.string "My wife must be looking for me.\p"
	.string "She's probably so worried.$"

Route132_Text_DarcyIntro:
	.string "I loved training here alone. Now all\n"
	.string "these people came!$"

Route132_Text_DarcyDefeat:
	.string "Okay! I won't complain about other\n"
	.string "people.$"

Route132_Text_DarcyPostBattle:
	.string "Maybe I'll team up with that old man and\n"
	.string "challenge his wife.\p"
	.string "She seems… free.$"

Route133_Text_FranklinIntro:
	.string "Did the currents bring you here too?\n"
	.string "Fate! Let's battle!$"

Route133_Text_FranklinDefeat:
	.string "Strong! Too strong!$"

Route133_Text_FranklinPostBattle:
	.string "Just my luck that a tough TRAINER\n"
	.string "drifted here…\p"
	.string "I must be cursed.$"

Route133_Text_DebraIntro:
	.string "I've led a life of woe and misery…\p"
	.string "I was cast away, and I drifted here…$"

Route133_Text_DebraDefeat:
	.string "Another loss… I'm collecting them.$"

Route133_Text_DebraPostBattle:
	.string "A life adrift… I don't want it anymore!\p"
	.string "Can someone call a boat? Anyone?$"

Route133_Text_LindaIntro:
	.string "Welcome! I've been expecting you!$"

Route133_Text_LindaDefeat:
	.string "No! Please! I just did my hair!$"

Route133_Text_LindaPostBattle:
	.string "A strong child TRAINER…\p"
	.string "That's so annoying!\p"
	.string "Go to school.$"

Route133_Text_WarrenIntro:
	.string "I want to win like everyone else.\p"
	.string "But I won't raise POKéMON like everyone\n"
	.string "else.$"

Route133_Text_WarrenDefeat:
	.string "Darn it! My way is still too slack!$"

Route133_Text_WarrenPostBattle:
	.string "Doing things my way is more fun than\n"
	.string "copying everyone.\p"
	.string "Obviously.\p"
	.string "I'm not like other TRAINERS.$"

Route133_Text_BeckIntro:
	.string "I came all the way out here with my BIRD\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "One of them is a RAICHU. Long story.$"

Route133_Text_BeckDefeat:
	.string "You're stunningly cool!$"

Route133_Text_BeckPostBattle:
	.string "I'd like to go back to FORTREE.\p"
	.string "But I like it here. No ladders.$"

Route133_Text_MollieIntro:
	.string "I've battled thousands of times. I lost\n"
	.string "count.$"

Route133_Text_MollieDefeat:
	.string "Thousands of losses, and it still\n"
	.string "stings.$"

Route133_Text_MolliePostBattle:
	.string "Keep at it, youngster.\p"
	.string "One day you'll be like my husband and me.\p"
	.string "Tired. But together.$"

Route133_Text_ConorIntro:
	.string "Young people just go with the flow.\p"
	.string "No direction!$"

Route133_Text_ConorDefeat:
	.string "You have a firm sense of purpose. And a\n"
	.string "firm handshake, I bet.$"

Route133_Text_ConorPostBattle:
	.string "Don't let others lead you astray.\p"
	.string "And don't lose direction as you get\n"
	.string "older.\p"
	.string "I'm 70 and lost on the sea. So.$"

Route134_Text_JackIntro:
	.string "Even swimming POKéMON get dragged\n"
	.string "along by these currents.$"

Route134_Text_JackDefeat:
	.string "AIYEEEEH! The current took my dignity!$"

Route134_Text_JackPostBattle:
	.string "POKéMON love the fast currents here.\p"
	.string "I hate them. I've been going in circles\n"
	.string "for an hour.$"

Route134_Text_LaurelIntro:
	.string "My LUVDISC want a fun match. Join us?$"

Route134_Text_LaurelDefeat:
	.string "Oopsie! Well, that happened.$"

Route134_Text_LaurelPostBattle:
	.string "There's a collector who wants LUVDISC\n"
	.string "SCALES.\p"
	.string "Creepy. Also, I sold him some.$"

Route134_Text_AlexIntro:
	.string "I saw a golem. Flying. Made of rocks.\n"
	.string "Then one made of ice.\p"
	.string "…Am I going crazy? Don't answer that.\n"
	.string "Battle me!$"

Route134_Text_AlexDefeat:
	.string "Tuckered out…\p"
	.string "The golems are flying again.$"

Route134_Text_AlexPostBattle:
	.string "My BIRD POKéMON get tired fast.\p"
	.string "Rocks don't. How do rocks fly?!$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiIntro:
	.string "JUST DO IT!!!$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiDefeat:
	.string "…Yesterday you said tomorrow.$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiPostBattle:
	.string "I challenged you and lost.\p"
	.string "Don't let your dreams be dreams…$"

Route134_Text_AaronIntro:
	.string "The savage tide here makes us stronger\n"
	.string "than ever.$"

Route134_Text_AaronDefeat:
	.string "I concede defeat.$"

Route134_Text_AaronPostBattle:
	.string "We'll train at METEOR FALLS again.\p"
	.string "You should go too. It toughens you up.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON came from the future. Don't\n"
	.string "ask.$"

Route134_Text_KelvinIntro:
	.string "A PERSON?! A real PERSON?!\p"
	.string "What year is it? How long has it been?\n"
	.string "Twenty years?!\p"
	.string "The tide took our boat and I've been\n"
	.string "here ever since. Battle me! I forgot how\l"
	.string "people work!$"

Route134_Text_KelvinDefeat:
	.string "Awawawah! Please, stop!\p"
	.string "I just got used to people again!$"

Route134_Text_KelvinPostBattle:
	.string "If we can't SURF, how do we get home?\p"
	.string "I've been asking since 2004.$"

Route134_Text_MarleyIntro:
	.string "Can your POKéMON dodge our\n"
	.string "lightning-fast attacks? No? Good.$"

Route134_Text_MarleyDefeat:
	.string "I never knew that technique existed!$"

Route134_Text_MarleyPostBattle:
	.string "I haven't lost my passion for speed.\p"
	.string "I'll try harder. Faster.$"

Route134_Text_ReynaIntro:
	.string "My POKéMON can't be taken down easily!$"

Route134_Text_ReynaDefeat:
	.string "You're kidding! Explain how I lost!$"

Route134_Text_ReynaPostBattle:
	.string "Haha! You won, all right!\p"
	.string "I'll work my way back up. One random\n"
	.string "TRAINER at a time.$"

Route134_Text_HudsonIntro:
	.string "Have you seen another SAILOR around\n"
	.string "here?$"

Route134_Text_HudsonDefeat:
	.string "Now that's something! Aye! You're a real\n"
	.string "sailor!$"

Route134_Text_HudsonPostBattle:
	.string "Our boat drifted out to sea.\p"
	.string "My buddy's a timid guy. I'm worried.\p"
	.string "It's been twenty years.$"

VSSeeker_Text_BatteryNotChargedNeedXSteps::
	.string "The battery isn't charged enough.\p"
	.string "Steps needed to fully charge the\n"
	.string "battery: {STR_VAR_1}{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"

VSSeeker_Text_NoTrainersWithinRange::
	.string "There are no Trainers in range who want\n"
	.string "to battle…\p"
	.string "The VS Seeker turned itself off. Rude.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"

VSSeeker_Text_TrainersNotReady::
	.string "The other Trainers aren't ready for\n"
	.string "battle yet.\p"
	.string "Let's wait a bit. Go touch grass.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"
